    "sourceBlob": "34d95191522637f67a8b0059a0fa565ab9407900",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are mounted and have a creature @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Grabbed] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Restrained].</p><hr /><p>Your mount attempts an Athletics check to [[/act trip]] the creature you've grabbed or restrained, then Strides. The grabbed or restrained creature keeps that condition and is pulled to a space within your reach. This is forced movement. If the grabbed or restrained creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Prone], it takes @Damage[2[slashing]] damage for every 5 feet it moved.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Requirements You are mounted and have a creature Grabbed or Restrained. Your mount attempts an Athletics check to [[/act trip]] the creature you've grabbed or restrained, then Strides. The grabbed or restrained creature keeps that condition and is pulled to a space within your reach. This is forced movement. If the grabbed or restrained creature is Prone, it takes damage slashing damage for every 5 feet it moved.",
