    "publication": "Pathfinder Lost Omens Character Guide",
    "path": "packs/pf2e/feats/archetype/knight-vigilant/aegis-of-arnisant.json",
    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/feats/archetype/knight-vigilant/aegis-of-arnisant.json",
    "sourceBlob": "9a6e45e1be7180d5db53ddc6da6b32c2585505fc",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are wielding a shield.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Inspired by the tale of Arnisant, you transform your shield into a magic ward. Until the beginning of your next turn, you gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Absorb into the Aegis] reaction.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Requirements You are wielding a shield. Inspired by the tale of Arnisant, you transform your shield into a magic ward. Until the beginning of your next turn, you gain the Absorb into the Aegis reaction.",
    "descriptionHash": "6edaa41d637ae0fa16e072ce02798dff17edb48a701c4d015de36f0d4d83a70e",
