    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are overflowing.</p><hr /><p>You channel some of the raw magical energy in your internal nexus into a devastating blast. You direct the blast at one creature within 30 feet, dealing @Damage[(floor(@actor.level/4))d12[force]] damage with a @Check[reflex|against:class-spell|basic] save against your nexus DC. The force damage increases by 1d12 at 8th level and every 4 levels thereafter. You are no longer overflowing.</p>",
