    "rarity": "common",
    "edition": "legacy",
    "publication": "Pathfinder Lost Omens Impossible Lands",
    "path": "packs/pf2e/feats/ancestry/vishkanya/level-9/alluring-performance.json",
    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/feats/ancestry/vishkanya/level-9/alluring-performance.json",
    "sourceBlob": "1d3ae76eef2220c0b8471923a539f3f7567eca36",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You command the attention of those around you with an elegant display. Attempt a @Check[performance] check and compare it to the Will DC of each creature in a @Template[emanation|distance:15].</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Fascinated] with you for as long as you perform (unless it breaks from the fascination, as normal for the condition) and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Dazzled] for 1 round or as long as it's fascinated, whichever is longer.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is fascinated for 1 round and is dazzled for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is dazzled for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Frequency once per day You command the attention of those around you with an elegant display. Attempt a performance check check and compare it to the Will DC of each creature in a emanation area template distance 15. Critical Success The target is Fascinated with you for as long as you perform (unless it breaks from the fascination, as normal for the condition) and is Dazzled for 1 round or as long as it's fascinated, whichever is longer. Success The target is fascinated for 1 round and is dazzled for 1 round. Failure The target is dazzled for 1 round. Critical Failure The target is unaffected.",
    "descriptionHash": "c3f566f48bcf7092f6b1d1196f1a743052584d12eeb83a201d5e8a9c48da050f",
