    "sourceBlob": "5c1bf25fd2f673269e6d70099d3ed740659f62b9",
    "description": "<p>You deepen the connection into your animal instincts. Your unarmed attack from bestial rage gains one of the following traits until you stop raging: backswing, forceful, parry, razing, or sweep. You can't use this ability again until the next time you @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Rage]. You can choose a different trait each time you use Animalistic Brutality.</p>",
