    "sourceBlob": "a33e5743e1fce8aa1bf7120ac1261e38f2e90384",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are wielding a ranged weapon.</p><hr /><p>Using your last shot to gauge your accuracy, you can fire off a quick shot to interfere with a foe in combat. Make a Strike with a ranged weapon. If the Strike hits, the next creature other than you to attack the same target before the start of your next turn gains a +1 circumstance bonus to their roll, or a +2 circumstance bonus if your Strike was a critical hit.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Assisting Shot]</p>",
