    "sourceBlob": "cec9b43a668dfdcb61e8733b6e1a50464bef9140",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per minute</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You use @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Advanced Alchemy] to craft an alchemical bomb that deals splash damage and is at least 2 levels lower than your @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Advanced Alchemy] level.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Your bomb incorporates an explosive spark of wonder that leaves witnesses dumbfounded. Any target hit by your Strike with the bomb is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Fascinated] by you for 1 round. On a critical success, the target is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stunned]{Stunned 1}.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Frequency once per minute Trigger You use Advanced Alchemy to craft an alchemical bomb that deals splash damage and is at least 2 levels lower than your Advanced Alchemy level. Your bomb incorporates an explosive spark of wonder that leaves witnesses dumbfounded. Any target hit by your Strike with the bomb is Fascinated by you for 1 round. On a critical success, the target is also Stunned 1.",
