    "sourceBlob": "5904b7ca2ff61886e660883b542762f47f19064f",
    "description": "<p>Invoking runes from two schools of magic that both manipulate the intangible realm of thought results in waves of mental interference that stagger your foes. You @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Invoke Rune]{Invoke} two Runes; one must be an arcane rune, and one must be an occult rune.</p>\n<p>In addition to the runes' normal effects, one creature within 30 feet of both invoked runes must attempt a @Check[will|against:runesmith|options:inflicts:stupefied] saving throw.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected by the compound invocation.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stupefied]{Stupefied 1} until the end of your next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stupefied]{Stupefied 2} until the end of your next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stupefied]{Stupefied 3} until the end of your next turn.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Invoking runes from two schools of magic that both manipulate the intangible realm of thought results in waves of mental interference that stagger your foes. You Invoke two Runes; one must be an arcane rune, and one must be an occult rune. In addition to the runes' normal effects, one creature within 30 feet of both invoked runes must attempt a will check saving throw. Critical Success The target is unaffected by the compound invocation. Success The target is Stupefied 1 until the end of your next turn. Failure The target is Stupefied 2 until the end of your next turn. Critical Failure The target is Stupefied 3 until the end of your next turn.",
