    "sourceBlob": "f49bfb8f529934640fb828212ae37345a3880dc1",
    "description": "<p>You open vestigial eyes, unfurl tympanic flaps of skin, or otherwise enhance your senses. Until the start of your next turn, you gain the following benefits: you can't be flanked; when you Seek for creatures, you can scan a @Template[cone|distance:60] or a @Template[burst|distance:30] instead of the normal area; and when you Seek for hidden objects, you can search a 15-foot square instead of the normal area.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Augment Senses]</p>",
    "plainDescription": "You open vestigial eyes, unfurl tympanic flaps of skin, or otherwise enhance your senses. Until the start of your next turn, you gain the following benefits: you can't be flanked; when you Seek for creatures, you can scan a cone area template distance 60 or a burst area template distance 30 instead of the normal area; and when you Seek for hidden objects, you can search a 15-foot square instead of the normal area. Effect: Augment Senses",
