    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Access</strong> mountain dwarf ethnicity</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An ally within 30 feet gains the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Dying] condition.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You honor your ally's life, gaining temporary Hit Points equal to your level for 1 minute. As long as you have these temporary Hit Points, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to attack and damage rolls.</p>",
