    "sourceBlob": "59525cecea9cea05667f83026fd1584e43511ee7",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p>You tap into the grandeur of your warren's benefactor. You gain temporary Hit Points equal to your level, which last for 1 minute. In addition, you can immediately attempt a flat check to remove each type of persistent damage you have. Finally, until the start of your next turn, any creature targeting you with a harmful attack, spell, or ability much first succeed at a @Check[flat|dc:11] or the action is disrupted as the creature avoids setting eyes upon your majesty.</p>",
