    "sourceBlob": "c9a02432870b408743e34362f9021a9e31a9ecac",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are within melee reach of a target, but it is not in combat with you.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>While your usual diplomacy is well intentioned, you know that sometimes those same skills will need to be turned to deception. In a flash, you draw a sheathed or concealed agile or finesse weapon and make a melee Strike. The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] against your Strike. You then roll Deception for initiative.</p>",
