    "sourceBlob": "475d469cb326c41584fbd8b0d3c02cadf2c8bf3d",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You would be moved by a forced movement effect.</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are wielding a melee weapon and are within reach of a hard surface.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You plow your weapon into a floor, wall, or another sturdy surface, anchoring yourself in place. If you would be moved 20 feet or more, you are moved only 5 feet. Otherwise, you don't move at all.</p>",
