    "path": "packs/pf2e/feats/class/gunslinger/level-1/blast-lock.json",
    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/feats/class/gunslinger/level-1/blast-lock.json",
    "sourceBlob": "ea47af11eda76d1ba8fdaaeb559452a82033646f",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're wielding a loaded firearm.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Sometimes taking the shortest distance between two points involves removing an obstacle or two. You shoot your firearm at a lock within 10 feet. Make an attack roll against the DC required to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Pick a Lock]{Pick the Lock}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> You open the lock, or you achieve two successes toward opening a complex lock.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> You open the lock, or you achieve one success toward opening a complex lock.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> You fail to open the lock, and your shot makes it harder to open. Future attempts to Pick the Lock or Blast the Lock take a -2 circumstance penalty.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> You fail to open the lock, and your shot makes it much harder to open. Future attempts to Pick the Lock or Blast the Lock take a -4 circumstance penalty.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Requirements You're wielding a loaded firearm. Sometimes taking the shortest distance between two points involves removing an obstacle or two. You shoot your firearm at a lock within 10 feet. Make an attack roll against the DC required to Pick the Lock Critical Success You open the lock, or you achieve two successes toward opening a complex lock. Success You open the lock, or you achieve one success toward opening a complex lock. Failure You fail to open the lock, and your shot makes it harder to open. Future attempts to Pick the Lock or Blast the Lock take a -2 circumstance penalty. Critical Failure You fail to open the lock, and your shot makes it much harder to open. Future attempts to Pick the Lock or Blast the Lock take a -4 circumstance penalty.",
