    "sourceBlob": "822bf64a442ef093b4146623b13ea8206af9d0b9",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per 10 minutes</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature damages you with a melee attack.</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Your attuned apparition grants Battlegrounds Lore or Volcano Lore as an apparition skill.</p><hr /><p>Your apparition grants fiery defenses. You gain resistance equal to your level against the triggering damage, and the triggering creature takes @Damage[(ternary(gte(@actor.level,18),3,ternary(gte(@actor.level,12),2,1)))d6[fire],(ternary(gte(@actor.level,18),3,ternary(gte(@actor.level,12),2,1)))[persistent,fire]] damage. This damage increases to 2d6 fire damage and 2 persistent fire damage at 12th level, and 3d6 fire damage and 3 persistent fire damage at 18th level.</p>",
