    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are in @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Rain of Embers Stance].</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You rush forward and latch onto your enemy with talons of hungering fire.</p>\n<p>Stride once. If you end your movement within reach of at least one enemy, you can make a fire talon Strike against that enemy that deals an additional @Damage[1d4[persistent,fire]] damage. If it hits and deals damage, you can attempt an Athletics check to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Grapple] the creature you hit.</p>",
