    "rarity": "common",
    "edition": "remaster",
    "publication": "Pathfinder Impossible Magic",
    "path": "packs/pf2e/feats/class/necromancer/level-14/blood-pool.json",
    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/feats/class/necromancer/level-14/blood-pool.json",
    "sourceBlob": "37f184ea18b34fd5d3051fb6ec91f71c2f4b7b34",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature with blood within 30 feet of you dies or takes bleed damage.</p><hr /><p>You use the lifeblood of your enemies to heal your allies. You pool the blood of the creature on the ground in a space adjacent to the triggering creature, infusing it with healing properties. The pool lasts for 1 minute or until absorbed by an ally. When an ally enters a space with a blood pool, they can absorb the blood pool as a free action, regaining @Damage[(@actor.level)[healing]]{Hit Points equal to your level}.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Trigger A creature with blood within 30 feet of you dies or takes bleed damage. You use the lifeblood of your enemies to heal your allies. You pool the blood of the creature on the ground in a space adjacent to the triggering creature, infusing it with healing properties. The pool lasts for 1 minute or until absorbed by an ally. When an ally enters a space with a blood pool, they can absorb the blood pool as a free action, regaining Hit Points equal to your level.",
    "descriptionHash": "ab535d9bbb0e5c3710c79864d708b2f09d241df1ebd349a44c5625d7f96a74b1",
    "classification": "native-active",
    "classificationReason": "Native actionType reaction:null; animation follows this feat's own chat card.",
    "trigger": "use",
    "theme": "blood",
    "motif": "groundCreation",
    "subject": "targets",
    "quality": "themed",
    "authored": false,
    "rationale": "Low blood pool grows near triggering creature; healing happens when ally later absorbs it.",
    "evidence": [
      "pool the blood"
    ],
