    "path": "packs/pf2e/feats/class/kineticist/level-4/born-to-the-trees.json",
    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/feats/class/kineticist/level-4/born-to-the-trees.json",
    "sourceBlob": "243f296e8b0a079d113b5484f126f94ae7c32d04",
    "description": "<p>You adapt a creature to live among the trees, improving its ability to climb, balance, and leap. Target a willing creature within 30 feet. For 10 minutes, it gains a climb Speed equal to its Speed and a +1 circumstance bonus to Acrobatics checks to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Balance] and Athletics checks to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Long Jump] and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.High Jump]. When it Leaps, it increases the distance it can @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Leap] horizontally by 5 feet and vertically by 2 feet. If you use Born to the Trees again, any existing one ends.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Born to the Trees]</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Level (6th)</strong> You can target up to 5 willing creatures.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "You adapt a creature to live among the trees, improving its ability to climb, balance, and leap. Target a willing creature within 30 feet. For 10 minutes, it gains a climb Speed equal to its Speed and a +1 circumstance bonus to Acrobatics checks to Balance and Athletics checks to Long Jump and High Jump. When it Leaps, it increases the distance it can Leap horizontally by 5 feet and vertically by 2 feet. If you use Born to the Trees again, any existing one ends. Effect: Born to the Trees Level (6th) You can target up to 5 willing creatures.",
