    "publication": "Pathfinder Lost Omens High Seas",
    "path": "packs/pf2e/feats/ancestry/tripkee/level-1/bounce-boost.json",
    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/feats/ancestry/tripkee/level-1/bounce-boost.json",
    "sourceBlob": "e929b3ecdc191c3291eadb8571bf65124e04c186",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An adjacent ally attempts to [[/act high-jump]] or [[/act long-jump]].</p><hr /><p>You've learned to use your own athletic abilities and springy legs to help others who need a boost with their leaps. The triggering ally gains a +1 circumstance bonus to their Athletics check to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.High Jump] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Long Jump]. This bonus increases to +2 if you're an expert in Athletics, +3 if you're a master, and +4 if you're legendary. Additionally, the triggering ally's [[/act leap]] distance on a successful check increases by 2 feet for a High Jump or 5 feet for a Long Jump, even if it would allow the ally to Leap further than their land Speed.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Bounce Boost]</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Trigger An adjacent ally attempts to [[/act high-jump]] or [[/act long-jump]]. You've learned to use your own athletic abilities and springy legs to help others who need a boost with their leaps. The triggering ally gains a +1 circumstance bonus to their Athletics check to High Jump or Long Jump. This bonus increases to +2 if you're an expert in Athletics, +3 if you're a master, and +4 if you're legendary. Additionally, the triggering ally's [[/act leap]] distance on a successful check increases by 2 feet for a High Jump or 5 feet for a Long Jump, even if it would allow the ally to Leap further than their land Speed. Effect: Bounce Boost",
    "descriptionHash": "6f2e8006eed0be2862b4a92f5dc1d27da87d3f0ba2081ce0388fa28951e2e010",
