      "You can spend 1 Mythic Point as part of performing this action; if you do, frightened creatures grovel before you, in awe of your terrible power. At the beginning of their turn, a creature that has the frightened condition from Brandish Authority must attempt a @Check[will|against:class-spell] saving throw against your class DC or spell DC, whichever is higher. On failure, they must Drop Prone. On a critical failure, they must Drop Prone and can't Stand this turn."
