    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A foe's Strike reduces you to 0 Hit Points; you were not at 1 Hit Point and you would not be killed.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Your confidence borders on self-delusion, but it keeps you going against overwhelming odds. Attempt a Deception check against the attack DC of the triggering Strike. You take a penalty to this check equal to twice your wounded value, if any. If the triggering attack was a critical hit, use the result one degree of success worse than what you rolled.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> You avoid being knocked out and remain at 1 Hit Point.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> You avoid being knocked out and remain at 1 Hit Point, but you increase your @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Wounded] value by 1.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Trigger A foe's Strike reduces you to 0 Hit Points; you were not at 1 Hit Point and you would not be killed. Your confidence borders on self-delusion, but it keeps you going against overwhelming odds. Attempt a Deception check against the attack DC of the triggering Strike. You take a penalty to this check equal to twice your wounded value, if any. If the triggering attack was a critical hit, use the result one degree of success worse than what you rolled. Critical Success You avoid being knocked out and remain at 1 Hit Point. Success You avoid being knocked out and remain at 1 Hit Point, but you increase your Wounded value by 1.",
