    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're in @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Bullet Dancer Stance].</p><hr /><p>You've learned to reload your firearms with uncanny grace, the ammunition simply falling into place as though part of a well-practiced kata. You Strike with a simple firearm, and then Interact to reload that same firearm. You don't need a free hand to reload your weapon in this way.</p>",
