    "sourceBlob": "111fdbcc66b459e2e01d041fb4f598c0d59a9153",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are undetected by a creature.</p><hr /><p>You appear from seemingly nowhere to grab an unsuspecting victim. Stride up to 10 feet and attempt to [[/act grapple]] a creature you are undetected by. If you succeed, you deal bludgeoning damage equal to your Strength modifier (@Damage[(@actor.system.abilities.str.mod)[bludgeoning]]) to the target (double damage if you critically succeed).</p>",
