    "sourceBlob": "87573f0d73d83229ce46eac0108b29094a0b9409",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Dying] condition of an ally you're observing would increase.</p><hr /><p>Even death halts in the face of your power. Spend a Mythic Point; the triggering ally loses the dying condition, their @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Wounded] condition doesn't increase, and they heal a number of Hit Points equal to @Damage[(2*@actor.level)[healing]]{twice your level}.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Trigger The Dying condition of an ally you're observing would increase. Even death halts in the face of your power. Spend a Mythic Point; the triggering ally loses the dying condition, their Wounded condition doesn't increase, and they heal a number of Hit Points equal to twice your level.",
