    "sourceBlob": "9249689b40391283a07ecd5ec2e958dcd96c049e",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You succeed at your save against an enemy's harmful spell, or an enemy fails a spell attack roll against you from a harmful spell.</p><hr /><p>When you resist a spell, you capture some of its magic for your own use. You enter your Arcane Cascade stance, using the triggering spell to determine what damage type your Arcane Cascade deals.</p>\n<p>Alternatively, if you're already in Arcane Cascade, you can instead amplify its effects temporarily. Until the end of your next turn, you gain a +2 status bonus to the extra damage and resistance you gain from your Arcane Cascade.</p>",
