    "sourceBlob": "8c9755512aedf70107f03ad86e8fd4c50773fc29",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An item you're holding, wearing, or wielding becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Broken] but not destroyed.</p><hr /><p>The stewarding abilities of your forebears allows you to repair objects important to you. The triggering item is restored to a number of Hit Points that is 1 higher than its Broken Threshold. For example, a steel shield with a Broken Threshold of 10 is restored to 11 Hit Points.</p>",
