    "sourceBlob": "ad2935adafca7885e6c9f6d3b4d7b6bc72217a9f",
    "description": "<p>The sheer force of your faith can bring a foe crashing down. If the next action you use is to cast @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Harm] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Heal] to damage one creature, the target is knocked @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Prone] if it takes any damage from the spell. If the target critically fails its save against the spell, it also takes a –10-foot status penalty to its Speed for 1 minute.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Cast Down]</p>",
