    "sourceBlob": "1ca94c6fcd69f0398c1035fc2d40bf90c3c0cb60",
    "description": "<p>You create a tune so catchy, your foes can't help but dance along. Attempt a @Check[performance] check against the Will DCs of all enemies in a @Template[emanation|distance:30].</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target takes a –10-foot status penalty to its Speed and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard], both for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes a –5-foot status penalty to its Speed for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is temporarily immune for 1 hour.</p>",
