    "rarity": "uncommon",
    "edition": "remaster",
    "publication": "Pathfinder Lost Omens Tian Xia Character Guide",
    "path": "packs/pf2e/feats/class/inventor/level-12/celestial-cacophony.json",
    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/feats/class/inventor/level-12/celestial-cacophony.json",
    "sourceBlob": "29563422807fdf63916f50bca3b512440a76e80c",
    "description": "<p><strong>Access</strong> Tian Xia origin</p><hr /><p>Your weapon contains a detonation chamber that launches fireworks, sparklers, and black powder pellets that sizzle, twist, and scatter on the ground in a cacophonous manner liable to annoy the entire Celestial Court. All creatures in a @Template[type:cone|distance:15] extending from your innovation take @Damage[(max(3,(floor(@actor.level / 2) - 3)))d4[fire],(max(3,(floor(@actor.level / 2) - 3)))d4[sonic]|options:area-damage] damage with a @Check[fortitude|against:inventor|basic] save against your class DC; both the fire and sonic damage increase by 1d4 at 14th level and every 2 levels thereafter. The area affected by the cone becomes difficult terrain until the start of your next turn. Creatures moving through this area must succeed at a @Check[reflex|against:inventor] save against your class DC or take @Damage[2d4[persistent,fire]] damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Unstable Function</strong> You rattle your weapon violently to make it belch out even more pyrotechnics. Add the unstable trait to Celestial Cacophony. The area increases to a @Template[type:cone|distance:30], and all damage dice increase from d4s to d8s.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Access Tian Xia origin Your weapon contains a detonation chamber that launches fireworks, sparklers, and black powder pellets that sizzle, twist, and scatter on the ground in a cacophonous manner liable to annoy the entire Celestial Court. All creatures in a type:cone area template distance 15 extending from your innovation take damage fire sonic damage with a fortitude check save against your class DC; both the fire and sonic damage increase by 1d4 at 14th level and every 2 levels thereafter. The area affected by the cone becomes difficult terrain until the start of your next turn. Creatures moving through this area must succeed at a reflex check save against your class DC or take damage fire damage. Unstable Function You rattle your weapon violently to make it belch out even more pyrotechnics. Add the unstable trait to Celestial Cacophony. The area increases to a type:cone area template distance 30, and all damage dice increase from d4s to d8s.",
    "descriptionHash": "a2ec9ef41eb1557bb43b0588fb9a7d8d67af23b375cd56ea5418fb5fa1162c9b",
