    "sourceBlob": "b8582484dcb3d507cc5d8be16cb644c85377d165",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per 10 minutes</p><hr /><p>You see the thin lines of magic between your creations, and you can exploit that connection with a small shift of power from one rune to another. You @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Invoke Rune]{Invoke} two Runes within 60 feet. In addition to the runes' normal effects, a chain of glowing script flows between them, dealing @Damage[max(5,(floor(@actor.level/2)))d6[force]|options:area-damage] damage to all creatures in a straight line between them with a @Check[reflex|against:runesmith|basic|options:area-effect,inflicts:immobilized] saving throw; creatures bearing the invoked runes are not in the area of this line. A creature who critically fails its save is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Immobilized] for 1 round or until it [[/act escape]]{Escapes}, as the runes seal its movements. The DC to Escape is your class DC. At 12th level, and every 2 levels thereafter, the damage increases by 1d6.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Frequency once per 10 minutes You see the thin lines of magic between your creations, and you can exploit that connection with a small shift of power from one rune to another. You Invoke two Runes within 60 feet. In addition to the runes' normal effects, a chain of glowing script flows between them, dealing damage force damage to all creatures in a straight line between them with a reflex check saving throw; creatures bearing the invoked runes are not in the area of this line. A creature who critically fails its save is also Immobilized for 1 round or until it [[/act escape]]{Escapes}, as the runes seal its movements. The DC to Escape is your class DC. At 12th level, and every 2 levels thereafter, the damage increases by 1d6.",
