    "sourceBlob": "2600ca27baf6c5f0bd60787a6cbe7992abeefabf",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You would die as a result of a failed recovery check or saving throw.</p><hr /><p>Your previous life ended due to sheer poor luck, struck by lightning or choking on a fish bone. You can reroll the triggering recovery check or saving throw, but you must use the new result, even if it's worse.</p><hr /><p><strong>Special</strong> You can select this feat only at 1st level, and you can't retrain into or out of this feat.</p>",
