    "sourceBlob": "13a9460b02e5ce2000340954e77b80e8289f5231",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p>You tap into the collective consciousness of the Godmind, the governing entity of axiomite society, to rapidly parse near-infinite variables to read your surroundings. For 1 minute, you gain precise motion sense out to 60 feet, you can see @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Invisible] creatures and objects, and you gain the benefits of @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Truesight] (with a counteract check modifier equal to your Perception modifier).</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Frequency once per day You tap into the collective consciousness of the Godmind, the governing entity of axiomite society, to rapidly parse near-infinite variables to read your surroundings. For 1 minute, you gain precise motion sense out to 60 feet, you can see Invisible creatures and objects, and you gain the benefits of Truesight (with a counteract check modifier equal to your Perception modifier).",
