    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Your next fire spell leaves embers in its wake. If your next action is to Cast a Spell with an area and the fire trait, for 1 minute, your spell's area becomes difficult terrain as well as hazardous terrain, dealing @Damage[1[fire]] damage for each square a creature moves through.</p>",
