    "sourceBlob": "26e41ae7debecfad497725e45f5c905e8d1aca2a",
    "description": "<p>You enter a tight stance, coiled up like a lashing cobra with your hands poised as venomous fangs.</p>\n<p>While in this stance, the only Strikes you can make are cobra fang unarmed attacks. These deal 1d4 piercing damage; are in the brawling group; and have the agile, deadly d10, finesse, unarmed, and venomous traits.</p>\n<p>While in Cobra Stance, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to Fortitude saves and your Fortitude DC, and you gain poison resistance equal to half your level.</p>",
