    "sourceBlob": "d609cde967e23794f8c09bd027f969643c610336",
    "description": "<p>With a quick flourish, you draw together runes and legal bindings to condemn a creature's soul and bring it to justice. Select a creature within 30 feet of you; that creature must attempt a @Check[will|against:class-spell] save against your class DC or spell DC, whichever is higher. Regardless of the result, the target is then temporarily immune to your Condemn Soul for 1 day.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> Your condemnation frays the fabric of the target's soul. The target gains weakness to fire and spirit damage equal to half your level for 1 minute. Only you can trigger this weakness.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but any creature can trigger the creature's weakness.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "With a quick flourish, you draw together runes and legal bindings to condemn a creature's soul and bring it to justice. Select a creature within 30 feet of you; that creature must attempt a will check save against your class DC or spell DC, whichever is higher. Regardless of the result, the target is then temporarily immune to your Condemn Soul for 1 day. Success The target is unaffected. Failure Your condemnation frays the fabric of the target's soul. The target gains weakness to fire and spirit damage equal to half your level for 1 minute. Only you can trigger this weakness. Critical Failure As failure, but any creature can trigger the creature's weakness.",
