    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Your eidolon has a creature @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Grabbed] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Restrained].</p><hr /><p>Your eidolon constricts the creature, dealing bludgeoning damage equal to your eidolon's level plus their Strength modifier, with a @Check[fortitude|basic|against:spell] save against your spell DC.</p>",
