    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are in animal or hybrid form and are flanked.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You become more dangerous when surrounded by enemies. You make unarmed Strikes against two different creatures flanking you. The attacks take a –2 penalty if the unarmed weapon is not agile. Both attacks count toward your multiple attack penalty, but the penalty doesn't increase until after you've made both of them.</p>",
