    "sourceBlob": "f5b9d40bfe281474bec2adf557c16d2023fbf6c8",
    "description": "<p>The ground on which you stride is mere fuel that you burn with unholy void energies, scarring the earth in your wake. When a holy creature or psychopomp ends its turn within 10 feet of you, it takes @Damage[(max(1,floor((@actor.level -2)/4)*2))[spirit]|options:area-damage] damage. If it's a holy living creature, it takes an additional @Damage[(max(1,floor((@actor.level -2)/4)*2))[void]|options:area-damage] damage. At 10th level and every 4 levels thereafter, the spirit and void damage each increase by 2. Corrupted Ground lasts for 1 minute, but you can Dismiss it.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "The ground on which you stride is mere fuel that you burn with unholy void energies, scarring the earth in your wake. When a holy creature or psychopomp ends its turn within 10 feet of you, it takes damage spirit damage. If it's a holy living creature, it takes an additional damage void damage. At 10th level and every 4 levels thereafter, the spirit and void damage each increase by 2. Corrupted Ground lasts for 1 minute, but you can Dismiss it.",
