    "sourceBlob": "388946aa1aac9f4d8baebd8df15c082b63b67170",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You would be reduced to 0 Hit Points but not immediately killed.</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are in Tenacious Stance.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You fight on, staying on your feet and lashing out at a foe. You avoid being knocked out and remain at 1 Hit Point, and your @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Wounded] condition increases by 1. Make a melee Strike at an enemy within reach. You immediately end your Tenacious Stance.</p>",
