    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You are targeted with an attack by an observed attacker.</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are in @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Crane Stance].</p><hr /><p>You interpose your arm between yourself and your opponent. Your circumstance bonus to AC from Crane Stance increases to +3 against the triggering attack. If the attack misses you and the attacker is within your reach, you can immediately make a crane wing Strike against the attacker at a -2 penalty.</p>",
