    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p>You gain a fire breath weapon similar to that of a crimson worm. You breathe a blast of flame in a @Template[cone|distance:30] that deals @Damage[((ceil(max(0,((@actor.level - 13)/2)))*2)+12)d6[fire]|options:area-damage] damage to all creatures in the area (@Check[reflex|against:class-spell|basic|options:area-effect] save). This damage increases by 2d6 at 14th level and every 2 levels thereafter.</p><hr /><p><em>Note: A DC was not provided for this ability by Paizo. The button above uses the better of your class or spell DC.</em></p>",
