    "sourceBlob": "3447b6d213bb3be96cf48921154b87d6c774e1d4",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature you are aware of critically succeeds on a Strike against you and would deal damage to you.</p><hr /><p>With pitiful posturing, you cause your foe to pull back a deadly attack. The attacking creature takes a circumstance penalty to the damage of the triggering Strike equal to your level + 2. This penalty applies after doubling the damage for a critical hit. The attacker is then immune to your Cringe for 24 hours.</p>",
