    "sourceBlob": "3eae95c9dcd4dd0aa07a772b497c2a1beaa7c16a",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are wielding a crossbow with reload 1 or higher.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Your deep understanding of the crossbow allows you to reload efficiently while moving yourself out of the line of return fire. Either @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Create a Diversion] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Take Cover], then Interact to reload. As normal, you must meet the requirements to Take Cover; you must be @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Prone], benefiting from cover, or near a feature that allows you to Take Cover.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Requirements You are wielding a crossbow with reload 1 or higher. Your deep understanding of the crossbow allows you to reload efficiently while moving yourself out of the line of return fire. Either Create a Diversion or Take Cover, then Interact to reload. As normal, you must meet the requirements to Take Cover; you must be Prone, benefiting from cover, or near a feature that allows you to Take Cover.",
