    "sourceBlob": "43bb3c3cab78cce794ada944662a9891338329be",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Grabbed] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Restrained] by a creature.</p><hr /><p>You counter the creature with the power of elemental water, a tendril of it encasing your limb or weapon. You attempt an Athletics check to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Grapple] the triggering creature, even if it's outside your reach or you don't have a free hand. If you succeed, you also remove the triggering condition, and the tendril of water pulls the creature adjacent to you before dissipating.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Trigger You become Grabbed or Restrained by a creature. You counter the creature with the power of elemental water, a tendril of it encasing your limb or weapon. You attempt an Athletics check to Grapple the triggering creature, even if it's outside your reach or you don't have a free hand. If you succeed, you also remove the triggering condition, and the tendril of water pulls the creature adjacent to you before dissipating.",
