    "sourceBlob": "38d713503306095b52b3e50bbb97167b5cab138e",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p><hr /><p>You let loose a yell of unbridled passion, which fuels your allies, and pounds against your foes. Allies within 60 feet who can hear you gain a +2 status bonus to attack rolls, Perception checks, saving throws, and skill checks for 1 minute.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Cry of Rebellion]</p>\n<p>Additionally, foes within 30 feet of you take @Damage[(@actor.level)d4[sonic]|options:area-damage] damage (@Check[fortitude|against:class-spell|basic|options:area-effect] save against your class DC or spell DC, whichever is higher). This sonic damage increases by 1d4 at 17th level and every level thereafter.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Frequency once per hour You let loose a yell of unbridled passion, which fuels your allies, and pounds against your foes. Allies within 60 feet who can hear you gain a +2 status bonus to attack rolls, Perception checks, saving throws, and skill checks for 1 minute. Effect: Cry of Rebellion Additionally, foes within 30 feet of you take damage sonic damage (fortitude check save against your class DC or spell DC, whichever is higher). This sonic damage increases by 1d4 at 17th level and every level thereafter.",
