    "sourceBlob": "aedaf4b400045da2c632d4e54e64dcfc60518a42",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are wielding a melee weapon with which you have expert proficiency.</p><hr /><p>Your belief in freedom can even sever magic. Select a magical effect that has made an adjacent member of your crop clumsy, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Grabbed], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Paralyzed], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Restrained], or slowed. You attempt to counteract that effect using your attack modifier with the required weapon as your counteract modifier. Your counteract rank is half your level rounded up. On a failure, you can't attempt to use Cut the Bonds on that effect on that crop member for 24 hours.</p>",
