    "sourceBlob": "b52ba4e889fb03e1cb0621936f1a621b97629557",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're wielding a melee weapon that bears a rune.</p><hr /><p>As you lash out, your weapon is your brush, wounds forming words of power in your target's flesh. You @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Invoke Rune]{Invoke a Rune} on a melee weapon you are wielding and Strike. Then, you can Step and Strike again with the same weapon. If the second Strike hits, you @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Trace Rune]{Trace a Rune} onto the target of the Strike. Both attacks count toward your multiple attack penalty, but you do not increase your penalty until you have made all your attacks.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Requirements You're wielding a melee weapon that bears a rune. As you lash out, your weapon is your brush, wounds forming words of power in your target's flesh. You Invoke a Rune on a melee weapon you are wielding and Strike. Then, you can Step and Strike again with the same weapon. If the second Strike hits, you Trace a Rune onto the target of the Strike. Both attacks count toward your multiple attack penalty, but you do not increase your penalty until you have made all your attacks.",
