    "sourceBlob": "6272c8c40a6667fa7ffce7c2056ce804c092b8a7",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are adjacent to an enemy.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Springing away from one foe, you Strike at another. Stride up to your Speed, but you must end that movement within melee reach of a different enemy. At the end of your movement, make a melee Strike against an enemy now within reach. You can use Dashing Strike while Burrowing, Climbing, Flying, or Swimming instead of Striding if you have the corresponding movement type.</p>",
