    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You have a creature @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Grabbed].</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You pummel a held foe, hoping to stagger them. Make a melee Strike against a creature you have grabbed. The weapon damage from this Strike is bludgeoning damage. If the Strike hits, the creature must attempt a @Check[fortitude|against:fighter|traits:incapacitation] save against your class DC; this is an incapacitation effect.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stunned]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stunned]{Stunned 2}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stunned]{Stunned 3}.</p>",
