    "sourceBlob": "6e6f53a01f903dd3120f42e31c361ca930dec473",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You use @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Shield Block].</p><hr /><p>As your shield blocks an assault, you create a flash of brilliant, multicolored light in a @Template[type:cone|distance:15]. Each creature in the area must attempt a @Check[fortitude|against:spell] save against your spell DC, with the following effects.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Dazzled] for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Blinded] for 1 round and dazzled for 1 minute. The creature can spend an Interact action rubbing its eyes to end this blinded condition.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is blinded for 1 round and dazzled for 1 hour.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Trigger You use Shield Block. As your shield blocks an assault, you create a flash of brilliant, multicolored light in a type:cone area template distance 15. Each creature in the area must attempt a fortitude check save against your spell DC, with the following effects. Critical Success The creature is unaffected. Success The creature is Dazzled for 1 round. Failure The creature is Blinded for 1 round and dazzled for 1 minute. The creature can spend an Interact action rubbing its eyes to end this blinded condition. Critical Failure The creature is blinded for 1 round and dazzled for 1 hour.",
