    "sourceBlob": "c455a8d0889503ded02f04cc3632cc77fbc0c219",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p>You create an aura of absolute despair around you, causing your enemies to struggle against their lamentations. For 1 minute, each enemy entering or beginning their turn within 30 feet of you must attempt a @Check[will|against:class-spell] save against the greater of your class DC or spell DC.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The enemy is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The enemy is unable to use reactions until the start of their next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> As success, and they are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Slowed]{Slowed 1} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As success, and they are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Slowed]{Slowed 2} for 1 round.</p>",
