    "sourceBlob": "665287dcfb9d40f288dacf5a6a6e97ad3ad458fc",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature you're aware of critically succeeds on a Strike against you.</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're under a polymorph effect that you can Dismiss.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You change your form as a means of evading a potentially fatal blow. You Dismiss the polymorph effect you're under, and the result of the triggering Strike becomes a success instead of a critical success. If you would no longer fit in your space as a result of returning to your normal form, this action fails and you don't Dismiss the polymorph effect.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Trigger A creature you're aware of critically succeeds on a Strike against you. Requirements You're under a polymorph effect that you can Dismiss. You change your form as a means of evading a potentially fatal blow. You Dismiss the polymorph effect you're under, and the result of the triggering Strike becomes a success instead of a critical success. If you would no longer fit in your space as a result of returning to your normal form, this action fails and you don't Dismiss the polymorph effect.",
