    "description": "<p>Your faith provides temporary protection in addition to healing. If the next action you use is to cast @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Harm] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Heal] on a single target and the target regains Hit Points from the spell, it also gains a +2 status bonus to AC and saving throws for 1 round.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Defensive Recovery]</p>",
