    "sourceBlob": "59be30fd94df1ca9f3d4df96b6cb8d94794943ac",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per 10 minutes</p><hr /><p>You produce rune-inscribed stones, which whirl in the air before darting away to form a perimeter for a runic canvas. The canvas is a @Template[type:burst|distance:20] on the ground centered on a corner in your space. As long as you're in or adjacent to the canvas, you can @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Trace Rune]{Trace a Rune} directly into the ground, which causes the rune to expand across the entire space, tracing it onto any number of eligible targets within the area. The canvas lasts for 1 minute.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Frequency once per 10 minutes You produce rune-inscribed stones, which whirl in the air before darting away to form a perimeter for a runic canvas. The canvas is a type:burst area template distance 20 on the ground centered on a corner in your space. As long as you're in or adjacent to the canvas, you can Trace a Rune directly into the ground, which causes the rune to expand across the entire space, tracing it onto any number of eligible targets within the area. The canvas lasts for 1 minute.",
