    "sourceBlob": "3ec590b3c2c34933c3ca216712a6e39b8c4381db",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An ally within the first range increment of your firearm or crossbow is hit by an attack, and you can see the attacker.</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're wielding a loaded firearm or crossbow.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You're always ready to take a quick shot to deflect a weapon or distract a foe enough to render them off target. The ally gains a +2 circumstance bonus to their AC against the triggering attack. You use this reaction after the result of the attack roll is revealed, so you know whether the +2 will make a sufficient difference.</p>",
