    "path": "packs/pf2e/feats/class/commander/level-14/desperate-resuscitation.json",
    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/feats/class/commander/level-14/desperate-resuscitation.json",
    "sourceBlob": "8ebaa0e4f4503d1232d769479f7b887f6679f097",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are holding a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Healer's Toolkit] or are wearing one and have a free hand; the target's body is mostly intact; the target was not killed by a death effect.</p><hr /><p>You can use your training in combat medicine to revive the recently deceased. Attempt a @Check[medicine|dc:40|showDC:all] check to revive a dead creature that has been dead for no more than 3 rounds. If you succeed, the target returns to life with the effects of @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Raise Dead], except it still has the wounded condition it had before dying, increased by 1 (or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Wounded]{Wounded 1} if it wasn't wounded before dying). Whether you succeed or fail, the target is temporarily immune to Desperate Resuscitation for 1 day.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Requirements You are holding a Healer's Toolkit or are wearing one and have a free hand; the target's body is mostly intact; the target was not killed by a death effect. You can use your training in combat medicine to revive the recently deceased. Attempt a medicine check check to revive a dead creature that has been dead for no more than 3 rounds. If you succeed, the target returns to life with the effects of Raise Dead, except it still has the wounded condition it had before dying, increased by 1 (or Wounded 1 if it wasn't wounded before dying). Whether you succeed or fail, the target is temporarily immune to Desperate Resuscitation for 1 day.",
    "descriptionHash": "145a25e51d52b12602c0bf0dd1a82657ed94427610893c939d6f269c3b645a3a",
