    "sourceBlob": "1bc66ec6bf23fea8f989887fd23b8a1e56fb80b6",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per 10 minutes</p><hr /><p>You can conjure up at will the kind of strength that most beings only attain in life-or-death situations. You can attempt to [[/act grapple statistic=spell-attack]], [[/act reposition statistic=spell-attack]], [[/act shove statistic=spell-attack]], or [[/act trip statistic=spell-attack]] a creature using a spell attack roll instead of an Athletics check.</p>\n<p>You can recharge this ability early by making an unarmed Strike to destroy one of your thralls within your reach.</p>",
