    "sourceBlob": "453b0e3c72b3684503127ad95c30d9a68420c59a",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> Your turn begins, and your current Hit Points are at half your maximum or less.</p><hr /><p>Your blood boils when you take a beating, and you throw caution to the wind to finish the fight. You get a +2 circumstance bonus to attack rolls, a –1 penalty to AC, and a –1 penalty to saves. These bonuses and penalties last until your Rage ends or until you are above half Hit Points, whichever comes first.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Trigger Your turn begins, and your current Hit Points are at half your maximum or less. Your blood boils when you take a beating, and you throw caution to the wind to finish the fight. You get a +2 circumstance bonus to attack rolls, a –1 penalty to AC, and a –1 penalty to saves. These bonuses and penalties last until your Rage ends or until you are above half Hit Points, whichever comes first.",
