    "description": "<p>Nothing can keep you from your enemy. Stride twice. During this movement you ignore difficult terrain, greater difficult terrain, and any effects that would impose a penalty to Speed.</p>\n<p>You can attempt an [[/act balance skill=athletics]]{Athletics} check instead of an Acrobatics check to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Balance] when moving across narrow surfaces or uneven ground, using the same DC. This doesn't prevent you from being harmed by hazardous terrain.</p>\n<p>You can increase the number of actions this activity takes to 3 to Stride three times instead.</p>",
