    "sourceBlob": "43e346dae07daa724f453e3191e2d0f8966d463b",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are wielding a single one-handed melee weapon and hold nothing else in your hands.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You adopt a fencing stance that improves your control over your weapon. While you are in this stance, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to Athletics checks to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Disarm] and a +2 circumstance bonus to your Reflex DC when defending against checks to Disarm you. In addition, you can attempt to Disarm creatures up to two sizes larger than you.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Requirements You are wielding a single one-handed melee weapon and hold nothing else in your hands. You adopt a fencing stance that improves your control over your weapon. While you are in this stance, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to Athletics checks to Disarm and a +2 circumstance bonus to your Reflex DC when defending against checks to Disarm you. In addition, you can attempt to Disarm creatures up to two sizes larger than you.",
