    "sourceBlob": "3e70d155283035fa41d30d29dd9b13d02761cde3",
    "description": "<p>The slightest distraction can provoke your wrath, and you're prepared to foil enemies' actions. As long as you are in this stance, you can use @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Reactive Strike] when a creature within your reach uses a concentrate action, in addition to manipulate and move actions. Furthermore, you disrupt a triggering concentrate or manipulate action if your Strike hits (not only if it's a critical hit).</p>",
