    "sourceBlob": "ff01fc4140e437f9c13e3f3201fde6d5eb7385d6",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p>Though you are not yet a god, you can invoke a measure of omnipotence that makes you high invulnerable. Spend a Mythic Point. You gain resistance to all damage equal to half your level for 1 minute as your aura smolders with power.</p>\n<p>During this time, if you cast a domain spell you received from this destiny, this resistance increases to equal your level until the beginning of your next turn.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Divine Invulnerability (Domain Spell)]</p>",
