    "path": "packs/pf2e/feats/archetype/dandy/level-12/do-you-know-who-i-am.json",
    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/feats/archetype/dandy/level-12/do-you-know-who-i-am.json",
    "sourceBlob": "9e58ce22499d80c8937585b1ee19dea4b85efdf9",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p><hr /><p>Your reputation casts a long shadow, allowing you to throw your cultural weight around, especially in larger settlements. With a well-timed tirade or attention-getting shout, you can break a foe's mind and bring them low. Choose a foe within 30 feet, and attempt an @Check[intimidation|against:will] check against the target's Will DC. You gain a +1 circumstance bonus to this check if you're in a city or a +2 circumstance bonus to this check if you're in a metropolis. If you're specifically in Absalom, the bonus is instead +3. The target is then temporarily immune to your Do You Know Who I Am? for 24 hours.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target takes @Damage[12d6[mental]] damage and becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 3}. It can't reduce its frightened condition below 1 if it ends its turn adjacent to you.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes @Damage[6d6[mental]] damage and becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 2}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is unaffected, and the embarrassment causes you to take @Damage[6d6[mental]] damage.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Frequency once per hour Your reputation casts a long shadow, allowing you to throw your cultural weight around, especially in larger settlements. With a well-timed tirade or attention-getting shout, you can break a foe's mind and bring them low. Choose a foe within 30 feet, and attempt an intimidation check check against the target's Will DC. You gain a +1 circumstance bonus to this check if you're in a city or a +2 circumstance bonus to this check if you're in a metropolis. If you're specifically in Absalom, the bonus is instead +3. The target is then temporarily immune to your Do You Know Who I Am? for 24 hours. Critical Success The target takes damage mental damage and becomes Frightened 3. It can't reduce its frightened condition below 1 if it ends its turn adjacent to you. Success The target takes damage mental damage and becomes Frightened 2. Failure The target is unaffected. Critical Failure The target is unaffected, and the embarrassment causes you to take damage mental damage.",
