    "sourceBlob": "390b73f17e3aa69f76f673b80d680e28de98fe24",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You are the target of a melee attack.</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're aware of the attack and aren't @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard].</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You use your acrobatic prowess to evade an attack, using momentum to keep yourself moving, if you choose.</p>\n<p>You gain a +1 circumstance bonus to AC against the triggering attack. If the attack misses you, you can @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Step] after the Strike.</p>\n<p>If you're a master in Acrobatics, you can move 10 feet on this Step instead of 5 feet.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Trigger You are the target of a melee attack. Requirements You're aware of the attack and aren't Off Guard. You use your acrobatic prowess to evade an attack, using momentum to keep yourself moving, if you choose. You gain a +1 circumstance bonus to AC against the triggering attack. If the attack misses you, you can Step after the Strike. If you're a master in Acrobatics, you can move 10 feet on this Step instead of 5 feet.",
    "descriptionHash": "b5057c41a42f52a06347fbed8d765b780c49b1950795d0d4c0a59404f8e9e2c5",
