    "sourceBlob": "b3e38365833ae80e0b467fafd4a517ae4f3a7f12",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p>For a short time, you fully manifest the expectations of the god destroyer within you. All creatures within a @Template[emanation|distance:10] take @Damage[8d6[force]|options:area-damage] damage with a @Check[fortitude|against:class-spell|basic|options:area-effect] save. A creature that fails this save is also knocked @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Prone]. For 1 minute, any creature who ends its turn within the 10-foot emanation takes @Damage[5d6[force]|options:area-damage] damage with a basic Fortitude save. If you aren't drained, you can choose to become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Drained]{Drained 2} when you use Dominion Aura to increase the radius of the emanation from 10 feet to 20 feet.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Frequency once per day For a short time, you fully manifest the expectations of the god destroyer within you. All creatures within a emanation area template distance 10 take damage force damage with a fortitude check save. A creature that fails this save is also knocked Prone. For 1 minute, any creature who ends its turn within the 10-foot emanation takes damage force damage with a basic Fortitude save. If you aren't drained, you can choose to become Drained 2 when you use Dominion Aura to increase the radius of the emanation from 10 feet to 20 feet.",
    "descriptionHash": "be9539c8f3d0d55de00cd653bef45d7e9232831b216a3f361b6493351d8d8217",
    "classification": "native-active",
