    "description": "<p>A haze of pollen floats around you. A creature in your kinetic aura when you enter the stance, or who later enters the aura or ends its turn in the aura, attempts at a @Check[fortitude|against:kineticist] save against your class DC. On a failure, it's @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 1} (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 2} on a critical failure) and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Dazzled] until it's no longer sickened. A creature attempts this save no more than once per round and doesn't attempt a new save if already affected.</p>",
