    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per minute</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You critically succeed with an unarmed Strike against an opponent.</p><hr /><p>Your powerful attack causes damage that reverberates through your opponent's body, shaking muscle from bone. The creature takes @Damage[10d6[bludgeoning]] damage with a @Check[fortitude|against:class|basic] save against your class DC. If it critically fails, it immediately dies as your blow tears apart its body internally.</p>",
