    "path": "packs/pf2e/feats/archetype/pure-legion-enforcer/level-8/edict-of-mortality.json",
    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/feats/archetype/pure-legion-enforcer/level-8/edict-of-mortality.json",
    "sourceBlob": "cf2ec77559c98bd675a4b078fd414c58d3dc41af",
    "description": "<p>You recite an excerpt of the Laws of Mortality, often the first law: \"Let no mortal be beholden to a god.\" Attempt an @Check[intimidation|against:will] check against all enemies within 60 feet that worship a deity, comparing your result against each target's Will DC. Targets are then temporarily immune to your use of this ability for 24 hours.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 2}. Until the start of your next turn, if the target attempts to Cast a Spell with the divine trait, it must succeed at a @Check[flat|showDC:all|dc:7] or the action is lost.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> As critical success, but @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 1}, and the DC of the @Check[flat|showDC:all|dc:5] is 5.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Edict of Mortality]</p>",
    "plainDescription": "You recite an excerpt of the Laws of Mortality, often the first law: \"Let no mortal be beholden to a god.\" Attempt an intimidation check check against all enemies within 60 feet that worship a deity, comparing your result against each target's Will DC. Targets are then temporarily immune to your use of this ability for 24 hours. Critical Success The target becomes Frightened 2. Until the start of your next turn, if the target attempts to Cast a Spell with the divine trait, it must succeed at a flat check or the action is lost. Success As critical success, but Frightened 1, and the DC of the flat check is 5. Effect: Edict of Mortality",
    "descriptionHash": "5ad56b9c66c3cd860100ae40cdd6ddf51977574bc6a1d51436e1181d4dbdcf1f",
