    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You're reduced to 0 hit points from damage that's neither acid nor fire.</p><hr /><p>You have battled against foes whose bodies naturally regenerate, and while yours doesn't do so all the time, it can happen in a pinch. You gain the effects of a 7th-rank @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Regenerate] spell. At 20th level, you gain the effects of a 9th-rank <em>regenerate</em> instead.</p>",
