    "sourceBlob": "5a25caa86a30d6d0ebed761fa3c69a5c160aa5c6",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are Channeling Draconic Essence.</p><hr /><p>Uncontainable power explodes from your spectral dragon. Your Channel Draconic Essence ends, and all creatures (except you) in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:10] from your spectral dragon take @Damage[(5+floor((@actor.level - 4)/2))d6|options:area-damage] damage with a @Check[reflex|against:class-spell|basic|options:area-effect] save against the higher of your class DC or spell DC. The damage's type matches the breath of your draconic benefactor. You then can't use Essence Overflow again for [[/r 1d4 #Recharge Essence Overflow]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>\n<p>At 8th level and every 2 levels thereafter, the damage increases by 1d6.</p>",
