    "sourceBlob": "4a2cb5ddcb862ba9e43d0b543ccc9ea5fa45b798",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An ally is about to use an action that requires an attack roll, targeting a creature within your weapon's first range increment.</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're wielding a loaded firearm or crossbow.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>With a skilled flourish of your weapon, you force an enemy to acknowledge you as a threat. Make an attack roll to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Aid] the triggering attack. If you dealt damage to that enemy with the same weapon since the start of your last turn, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to this roll.</p>",
