    "sourceBlob": "205413409330d788d748eebedc4259db2c6961ab",
    "description": "<p>You use your familiar's senses as easily as your own.</p>\n<p>You project your senses into your familiar. When you do, you lose all sensory information from your own body, but you can sense through your familiar's body until you @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Dismiss] the effect.</p>\n<p>While projecting your senses in this way, you can converse telepathically with your familiar if it understands a language.</p><hr /><p><strong>Special</strong> This feat has the trait corresponding to the tradition of spells you cast (arcane, divine, occult, or primal).</p>",
