    "sourceBlob": "baa6881d6b4bc5c2cb8043a6a1d52fd5b923ea72",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p>You modify an arrow or bolt to bring death to your target in a single potent hit. Make a bow or crossbow Strike. On a hit, you deal an additional 10d10 precision damage. On a critical hit, the target must also succeed at a @Check[fortitude|against:class-spell|traits:death,incapacitation] saving throw against the higher of your class DC or spell DC or be immediately slain; this save has the death and incapacitation traits.</p>",
