    "sourceBlob": "032ac2daae9ae96b5d5945aa0b70b3717e90a63a",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You would take damage from a Strike made by a creature.</p><hr /><p>As you are struck, your steely determination reminds those who fight you that they are destined to be no more than footnotes in your tale. Spend a Mythic Point to gain resistance equal to half your level to the triggering damage, and then attempt a Strike at mythic proficiency against the creature that attacked you. If the Strike hits and deals damage, the creature is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Slowed]{Slowed 1}.</p>",
