    "sourceBlob": "35c133ed970051aea00737171672b8400eb2fc19",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're in hybrid or animal shape.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You spring on an unsuspecting opponent, tearing at them with your teeth. You Stride up to 10 feet and make a jaws Strike at the end of that movement. If you began this action @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Hidden], you remain hidden until after this Strike. If you have a fly or swim Speed, you can Fly or Swim up to 10 feet instead of Stride</p>",
