    "sourceBlob": "dda121546d2ae80504a51d642fe9a1ba6f871a6c",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You succeed at a saving throw against a magical mental effect.</p><hr /><p>You send a blast of magical feedback at the effect's source, dealing @Damage[ceil(@actor.level/2)d6[mental]] damage with a @Check[will|against:class-spell|basic|options:inflicts:slowed] save against your class DC or spell DC, whichever is higher. If the target critically fails, it's also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Slowed]{Slowed 1} for 1 round. At 11th level and every 2 levels thereafter, the damage increases by 1d6.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Frequency once per hour Trigger You succeed at a saving throw against a magical mental effect. You send a blast of magical feedback at the effect's source, dealing damage mental damage with a will check save against your class DC or spell DC, whichever is higher. If the target critically fails, it's also Slowed 1 for 1 round. At 11th level and every 2 levels thereafter, the damage increases by 1d6.",
