    "sourceBlob": "50ec2f7a140d4e8948b1866611aee04195908473",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You challenge a single ally to a physical competition. This competition must involve accomplishing a specific goal for a specific use of the Acrobatics or Athletics skill, such as @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Climb]{Climbing} to the top of a wall, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Trip]{Tripping} a specific foe, or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Long Jump]{Long Jumping} across a chasm. You and your selected ally gain a +2 circumstance bonus to the associated skill check for 1 minute or until one of you wins the challenge, whichever is first. If you win this competition, you gain a +2 status bonus to Intimidation checks for 1 hour.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Frequency once per day You challenge a single ally to a physical competition. This competition must involve accomplishing a specific goal for a specific use of the Acrobatics or Athletics skill, such as Climbing to the top of a wall, Tripping a specific foe, or Long Jumping across a chasm. You and your selected ally gain a +2 circumstance bonus to the associated skill check for 1 minute or until one of you wins the challenge, whichever is first. If you win this competition, you gain a +2 status bonus to Intimidation checks for 1 hour.",
