    "sourceBlob": "1f4f120f3bcbe5146699dbdc95b650c2e7de6157",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per 10 minutes</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature reduces you or a living ally within 30 feet to 0 Hit Points.</p><hr /><p>You can trigger this action even while @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Dying]. You can channel the power of death into a poisonous spite. The triggering creature takes @Damage[4d4[persistent,poison]] damage with a @Check[fortitude|against:spell|basic] save against your spell DC. If the creature kills you or your ally as part of the trigger, the creature gets a result one degree of success worse than it rolls on this save.</p>",
