    "sourceBlob": "c243112aa7c94800020a3476558481290cf989f3",
    "description": "<p>You're able to quickly disappear and then move about stealthily. You @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Hide], then @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Sneak] twice.</p>",
