    "sourceBlob": "7eac5d69b166de4ade053b75ef35525d4f500430",
    "description": "<p>You take a moment to center yourself, then unleash a powerful blow that sends your target tumbling away.</p>\n<p>Make an unarmed Strike. If you hit, the target must succeed at a Fortitude save against your class DC or be pushed up to 10 feet directly away from you (or 20 feet, on a critical failure) and fall @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Prone].</p>\n<p>If another creature or physical object would prevent this movement, both your target and the blocking creature or object take @Damage[1d6[bludgeoning]] damage per 5 feet of movement that was prevented.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "You take a moment to center yourself, then unleash a powerful blow that sends your target tumbling away. Make an unarmed Strike. If you hit, the target must succeed at a Fortitude save against your class DC or be pushed up to 10 feet directly away from you (or 20 feet, on a critical failure) and fall Prone. If another creature or physical object would prevent this movement, both your target and the blocking creature or object take damage bludgeoning damage per 5 feet of movement that was prevented.",
    "descriptionHash": "696c4b9f85d1dad581b7fe22c1424fb059f5115d52b807a096c02eb1a6d0eddd",
