    "description": "<p>A Tiny shape of flame appears, taking a form of your choice—such as a bird, an arrow, or a simple sphere. It Flies from you up to 30 feet in a path you choose. Each creature it passes through takes @Damage[(floor((@actor.level -1)/2)+1)d6[fire]] damage with a @Check[reflex|against:kineticist|basic] save against your class DC. A creature attempts only one save, even if the flame passes through it multiple times.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Level (+2)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>",
