    "sourceBlob": "616baf984286c22708c668a0a84308d70ad6e59a",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are wielding a shield.</p><hr /><p>Your shield is a natural canvas for your art. In one motion, you @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Raise a Shield] and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Trace Rune]{Trace a Rune} on your shield.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Requirements You are wielding a shield. Your shield is a natural canvas for your art. In one motion, you Raise a Shield and Trace a Rune on your shield.",
    "descriptionHash": "9f7a3f52c28d1a0b1d866d86640efd01bd1328909ffeb4d2e4eb86effd4537a6",
