    "sourceBlob": "914597c4db54603e1b1cdd4f3d5bdd393ebdac0d",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An ally within your reach is about to attempt a skill check to Escape</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The triggering ally attempts the check to Escape with a +1 circumstance bonus, and if they don't critically fail, they can Strike an enemy within reach as a reaction (if possible). Both attack actions count toward their multiple attack penalty, but the penalty doesn't increase until after both attack actions have been made.</p>",
