    "sourceBlob": "6e436a8e74ffed36ea438204ca56f0f8a924685f",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are adjacent to an enemy that harmed a member of your crop during their last turn or has a member of your crop @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Grabbed] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Restrained].</p><hr /><p>Sometimes you must dispose of a threat to your crop for good. Strike the required enemy. On a hit, the target takes @Damage[1d6[persistent,bleed]] damage per weapon damage die. On a critical hit, the target also drops anything they're holding and releases anyone they have @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Grabbed] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Restrained].</p>",
