    "sourceBlob": "385e6a90fefb33b3642fbf1527579cf38e2bbcac",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature you are aware of damages you with a melee Strike.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Your wound yawns open, appalling your attacker. The attacker must succeed at a @Check[fortitude|against:class-spell] saving throw against your class or spell DC, whichever is higher, or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 1} (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 2} on a critical failure). It can't recover from the sickened condition while it's adjacent to you.</p>",
