    "sourceBlob": "d6536bcf8158350871b6e4bdc84e092d83ce2292",
    "description": "<p><strong>Access</strong> Tian Xia origin</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You would take damage.</p><hr /><p>Your armor has a retractable spike-covered shell reminiscent of Hwanggot's heavily armored geobukseon, or \"turtle ships.\" The shell unfolds across your body, giving you a +4 circumstance bonus to AC and resistance 2 to bludgeoning, piercing, and slashing damage until the end of your next turn. Spiked chains propelled by small bursts of black powder also erupt from the shell, dealing @Damage[3d4[piercing],2[persistent,fire]|options:area-damage] damage (@Check[reflex|against:inventor|basic] save against your class DC) to all creatures in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:5].</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Access Tian Xia origin Trigger You would take damage. Your armor has a retractable spike-covered shell reminiscent of Hwanggot's heavily armored geobukseon, or \"turtle ships.\" The shell unfolds across your body, giving you a +4 circumstance bonus to AC and resistance 2 to bludgeoning, piercing, and slashing damage until the end of your next turn. Spiked chains propelled by small bursts of black powder also erupt from the shell, dealing damage piercing fire damage (reflex check save against your class DC) to all creatures in a type:emanation area template distance 5.",
