    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p>Vitality floods your trammeled soul, offering you rejuvenation, if not quite rest. For each effect that causes the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Enfeebled] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Fatigued] conditions to affect you, attempt a @Check[nature] check to counteract that effect. The counteract rank of Germination of Resolve is equal to half your level rounded up.</p>",
