    "sourceBlob": "60eb4c269f48fc8250b4bf9bf61a8462316d2e61",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature detects your attempt to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Impersonate], and you're within 30 feet of at least one other creature.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You have an occult connection to the world that helps you blend in with the cacophony of life around you. Attempt an @Check[occultism|defense:perception] check against the creature's Perception DC. On a success, the creature mistakenly identifies another creature within 30 feet of you as you instead.</p>",
