    "sourceBlob": "7ba116e5333f136eeb72a26d7e9e785dbc63dddd",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're in Masquerade of Seasons Stance.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You can summon the full magic of Bhopan's grand dance. Stride up to your Speed; during this Stride, you can walk on air as if it were solid ground. You can ascend and descend in this way at a maximum of a 45-degree angle. You must end your Stride on a surface that can support you or you fall.</p>",
