    "rarity": "rare",
    "edition": "remaster",
    "publication": "Pathfinder #218: Titanbane",
    "path": "packs/pf2e/feats/archetype/warrior-of-legend/griefs-fury.json",
    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/feats/archetype/warrior-of-legend/griefs-fury.json",
    "sourceBlob": "996f8b58f7001183b404523ca55fc3880c15437c",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> Your bonded partner gains the dying condition or their dying value would increase.</p><hr /><p>A lost love. A broken spear. Rage burning through a hero-god. When a myth speaks of a wounded partner, the hero-god often rejects the future. Too many find themselves on a battlefield, clutching a body that they swore to protect. In that moment, the wellspring of power ignites.</p>\n<p>Increase the value of your @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Doomed] condition by 1, to a maximum of @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Doomed]{Doomed 3}. You gain a +2 status bonus to attack rolls against any creature that attacked or dealt damage to your partner in the last minute. If you reduce a creature to 0 HP that attacked or damaged your partner, you gain temporary Hit Points equal to twice their level. These benefits last until your bonded partner is no longer @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Unconscious] or for 1 minute, whichever duration is shorter.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Frequency once per day Trigger Your bonded partner gains the dying condition or their dying value would increase. A lost love. A broken spear. Rage burning through a hero-god. When a myth speaks of a wounded partner, the hero-god often rejects the future. Too many find themselves on a battlefield, clutching a body that they swore to protect. In that moment, the wellspring of power ignites. Increase the value of your Doomed condition by 1, to a maximum of Doomed 3. You gain a +2 status bonus to attack rolls against any creature that attacked or dealt damage to your partner in the last minute. If you reduce a creature to 0 HP that attacked or damaged your partner, you gain temporary Hit Points equal to twice their level. These benefits last until your bonded partner is no longer Unconscious or for 1 minute, whichever duration is shorter.",
    "descriptionHash": "6629e87f53494cfe7670a41818a61e03125b8cda8c82ef38f6485c25dc03ffbb",
