    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Your attuned apparition grants Heraldry Lore or Underworld Lore as an apparition skill.</p><hr /><p>You channel the spiritual power of spiteful grudges. Make a melee Strike against a creature within your reach. You gain a +2 circumstance bonus to your attack roll and deal an additional @Damage[2d6[void]] damage to the target; if the target is undead or otherwise has void healing, this Strike instead deals an additional @Damage[2d6[vitality]] damage. This ability gains the vitality trait if it deals vitality damage, or the void trait if it deals void damage.</p>",
