    "sourceBlob": "f9dff30380a1d232f4c47603bc59f5a8cd08b31a",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An enemy within 30 feet damages you or succeeds at a skill check.</p><hr /><p>Every Firebrand can recognize the skill of others, but you've turned it into an art you can wield in combat. You compliment a foe's form or technique, and your unexpected praise distracts them from their surroundings. Attempt a @Check[diplomacy|defense:will] check against that enemy's Will DC. Regardless of your result, they are temporarily immune to your Grudging Compliments for 10 minutes.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target becomes off-guard against your attacks for 1 round.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Trigger An enemy within 30 feet damages you or succeeds at a skill check. Every Firebrand can recognize the skill of others, but you've turned it into an art you can wield in combat. You compliment a foe's form or technique, and your unexpected praise distracts them from their surroundings. Attempt a diplomacy check check against that enemy's Will DC. Regardless of your result, they are temporarily immune to your Grudging Compliments for 10 minutes. Critical Success The target becomes Off Guard for 1 round. Success The target becomes off-guard against your attacks for 1 round.",
