    "sourceBlob": "e185063a0cc72df9f8a862e5bb8fae2e500d6645",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An ally within your melee reach is hit by an attack, you can see the attacker, and the ally gaining a +2 circumstance bonus to AC would turn the critical hit into a hit or the hit into a miss.</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are wielding a single one-handed melee weapon and hold nothing else in your hands.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You use your weapon to deflect the attack against your ally, granting a +2 circumstance bonus to their Armor Class against the triggering attack. This turns the triggering critical hit into a hit, or the triggering hit into a miss.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Guardian's Deflection]</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Trigger An ally within your melee reach is hit by an attack, you can see the attacker, and the ally gaining a +2 circumstance bonus to AC would turn the critical hit into a hit or the hit into a miss. Requirements You are wielding a single one-handed melee weapon and hold nothing else in your hands. You use your weapon to deflect the attack against your ally, granting a +2 circumstance bonus to their Armor Class against the triggering attack. This turns the triggering critical hit into a hit, or the triggering hit into a miss. Effect: Guardian's Deflection",
