    "sourceBlob": "fa5b05e5a3ce47b949aa96fc131f33a008c68ae8",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're wielding a loaded one-handed firearm.</p><hr /><p>Your flair keeps foes' attention, as your motions with your gun draw your foes into a deadly game. As you toy with them and performatively brandish your weapon, you build their tunnel vision, leaving them trapped in a perceptual gauntlet of your own making. Attempt a @Check[performance|against:will] check against the Will DC of a single target within your one-handed firearm's first range increment.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target takes a –2 status penalty to attack rolls against creatures other than you until the beginning of your next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes a –1 status penalty to attack rolls against creatures other than you until the beginning of your next turn.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Gunpowder Gauntlet]</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Requirements You're wielding a loaded one-handed firearm. Your flair keeps foes' attention, as your motions with your gun draw your foes into a deadly game. As you toy with them and performatively brandish your weapon, you build their tunnel vision, leaving them trapped in a perceptual gauntlet of your own making. Attempt a performance check check against the Will DC of a single target within your one-handed firearm's first range increment. Critical Success The target takes a –2 status penalty to attack rolls against creatures other than you until the beginning of your next turn. Success The target takes a –1 status penalty to attack rolls against creatures other than you until the beginning of your next turn. Effect: Gunpowder Gauntlet",
    "descriptionHash": "ab8773799f08a725d036c46f48819ec396af3851f3e9e3536bcdf996fcaa868b",
