    "path": "packs/pf2e/feats/class/shared-class-feats/level-10/halyard-strike.json",
    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/feats/class/shared-class-feats/level-10/halyard-strike.json",
    "sourceBlob": "1ec6cda38fa67cb12cc08a6573ae83e1fc61cf4b",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> A rope is within your reach, or you have a rope or grappling weapon in your hand.</p><hr /><p>You've learned to fight confidently while swinging from a line. You take hold of a nearby rope, throw a rope from your hand, or fire a grappling weapon at a solid surface, and then swing up to twice your Speed. You can make a Strike using a one-handed weapon or unarmed attack at any point during this movement. If you critically fail on this Strike, your movement ends at the point you attempted the Strike.</p><hr /><p><strong>Special</strong> If you have @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Pirate Dedication] and you boarded or disembarked from a boat or similar vehicle during this movement, the Strike deals one additional weapon damage die.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Requirements A rope is within your reach, or you have a rope or grappling weapon in your hand. You've learned to fight confidently while swinging from a line. You take hold of a nearby rope, throw a rope from your hand, or fire a grappling weapon at a solid surface, and then swing up to twice your Speed. You can make a Strike using a one-handed weapon or unarmed attack at any point during this movement. If you critically fail on this Strike, your movement ends at the point you attempted the Strike. Special If you have Pirate Dedication and you boarded or disembarked from a boat or similar vehicle during this movement, the Strike deals one additional weapon damage die.",
