    "sourceBlob": "6ce936089f10ca78fed3bb502409e0eebb40ca14",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You would take a critical hit that deals physical damage.</p><hr /><p>Your partly undead flesh becomes resistant to the strongest physical attacks. You gain resistance 6 to the triggering damage; this resistance increases to 8 at 13th level, and to 10 at 17th level. However, you are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Slowed]{Slowed 1} for 1 round as your joints seize up and your hardened flesh makes it difficult to move.</p>",
