    "sourceBlob": "fded8aa76d928aef7afc16db3aa463c42969b3c0",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Your previous action was a Strike with your spectral dagger that dealt spirit damage.</p><hr /><p>Once your spectral dagger has tasted an enemy's soul, your splinter of finality becomes increasingly relentless in its attempts to claim the soul. Your <em>spectral dagger</em> gains the effects of a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Keen] property rune that applies only to Strikes against the target of the required Strike. This effect lasts for 10 minutes or until that target dies, whichever comes first.</p>",
