    "description": "<p>You make a ranged Strike with a thrown weapon you already have in your hand, Stride, and then @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Interact] to draw another weapon.</p><hr /><p><strong>Special</strong> If you are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Rage]{Raging}, and end the Stride adjacent to an enemy, that enemy is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] against the next Strike you make against it with the weapon you drew before the end of your next turn.</p>",
