    "classTraits": [],
    "traits": [
      "nephilim"
    ],
    "rarity": "common",
    "edition": "legacy",
    "publication": "Pathfinder Lost Omens Impossible Lands",
    "path": "packs/pf2e/feats/ancestry/versatile-heritages/nephilim/idol-threat.json",
    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/feats/ancestry/versatile-heritages/nephilim/idol-threat.json",
    "sourceBlob": "62cff0346e91ff5de3c561469cd0dea55f0edb42",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're holding something sacred or precious to a creature, such as a relic or personal depiction of their deity or a precious personal memento.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You brandish the precious object you're holding menacingly, at once mocking it and threatening its safety. Attempt to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Demoralize] the creature whose precious item you threaten. You gain a +2 circumstance bonus to the Intimidation check to Demoralize, and on a success, the creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] for 1 round out of distraction for the object's safety and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stupefied]{Stupefied 1} for 1 minute (or stupefied 2 on a critical success). These conditions are both in addition to the normal effects of Demoralize. The creature is then temporarily immune to any Idol Threat using that specific object for 1 day.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Requirements You're holding something sacred or precious to a creature, such as a relic or personal depiction of their deity or a precious personal memento. You brandish the precious object you're holding menacingly, at once mocking it and threatening its safety. Attempt to Demoralize the creature whose precious item you threaten. You gain a +2 circumstance bonus to the Intimidation check to Demoralize, and on a success, the creature is Off Guard for 1 round out of distraction for the object's safety and is Stupefied 1 for 1 minute (or stupefied 2 on a critical success). These conditions are both in addition to the normal effects of Demoralize. The creature is then temporarily immune to any Idol Threat using that specific object for 1 day.",
    "descriptionHash": "c1b42a079a453ced26ba9daa5fefd95f6a1a996f6c67d35d8e11a524777e8f66",
