    "sourceBlob": "bd82bfb9c200e7f1854275e378a5e9b79be66194",
    "description": "<p>Your strikes flow endlessly. Step and attempt a single one-action finisher. This Strike gains the bravado trait, possibly replenishing your @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Panache]; if you regain panache, you can immediately attempt another finisher as part of this action, ignoring the restriction of using actions with the attack trait after a finisher.</p>",
