    "sourceBlob": "8b6f8d15a3744a2e42e8f975a71220363fd7e5e6",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're in an elemental stance.</p><hr /><p>Your blows can disrupt the delicate balance of elemental energies that keep a body in good health. Strike the target using the unarmed attack associated with your current elemental stance. On a success, the target must attempt a @Check[fortitude|against:class] save against your class DC. On a failure, the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Clumsy]{Clumsy 2} until the end of your next turn. On a critical failure, the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Clumsy]{Clumsy 3} for 1 minute. Elementals take a –2 circumstance penalty to their save.</p>",
