    "sourceBlob": "b71960c5e22840418f65a34098cfe27399796e81",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're wielding your order's favored weapon.</p><hr /><p>Your attacks force a foe to glimpse the iron, soul-wrenching landscapes of Hell. Strike an enemy with the required weapon twice. If either Strike hits, the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stupefied]{Stupefied 1} and can't use reactions until the beginning of your next turn. If both Strikes hit, the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stupefied]{Stupefied 3} instead.</p>",
