    "sourceBlob": "f26b2c9e211c6b799c0f2c38436325eb2d224770",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature or object adjacent to you damages you.</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Your inscribed runes are currently intact.</p><hr /><p>Some of the patterning on your exterior covering is not just decorative but is instead a set of runes. The triggering creature or object takes @Damage[(1+floor(@actor.level/5))d4[force]] damage and your inscribed runes fade. You re-inscribe your runes each day during your daily preparations. At 10th level and every 5 levels thereafter, the damage increases by 1d4.</p>\n<p><strong>Enhancement</strong> You can re-inscribe your runes with 10 minutes of work as an exploration activity.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Trigger A creature or object adjacent to you damages you. Requirements Your inscribed runes are currently intact. Some of the patterning on your exterior covering is not just decorative but is instead a set of runes. The triggering creature or object takes damage force damage and your inscribed runes fade. You re-inscribe your runes each day during your daily preparations. At 10th level and every 5 levels thereafter, the damage increases by 1d4. Enhancement You can re-inscribe your runes with 10 minutes of work as an exploration activity.",
