    "sourceBlob": "2820b6d7f0f6d45c52d648ee221941bd671b2365",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You are attacked by a foe, but they haven't rolled yet.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>The magic within you manifests as a natural reaction to threats. An illusory double of you appears in your space for a brief moment. The triggering attacker must roll a @Check[flat|dc:10]; on a success, the attack targets you normally; if they fail, the attack targets the double and destroys it. The tradition of this action matches the tradition of your gnome ancestry options.</p>",
