    "sourceBlob": "7ddab45cf789b89d6c4cfeafcbecae89150a8aba",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p>You summon an aura of shimmering heat, flurrying snow, crashing waves, or swirling wind and lightning.</p>\n<p>For 1 minute, you gain @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Concealed]{Concealment} against creatures more than 5 feet away, and any creature that ends its turn within 5 feet of you suffers @Damage[(ternary(gte(@actor.level,17),3,ternary(gte(@actor.level,13),2,1)))d12[@item.flags.system.rulesSelections.changelingType]] damage (@Check[reflex|against:class-spell|basic] save using your class DC or spell DC, whichever is higher).</p>\n<p>At 13th and 17th level, this damage increases by 1d12.</p>\n<p>A veil may changeling deals fire damage, a snow may changeling deals cold damage, a brine may changeling deals bludgeoning damage and the effect gains the water trait, and a virga may changeling deals electricity damage.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Frequency once per day You summon an aura of shimmering heat, flurrying snow, crashing waves, or swirling wind and lightning. For 1 minute, you gain Concealment against creatures more than 5 feet away, and any creature that ends its turn within 5 feet of you suffers damage damage (reflex check save using your class DC or spell DC, whichever is higher). At 13th and 17th level, this damage increases by 1d12. A veil may changeling deals fire damage, a snow may changeling deals cold damage, a brine may changeling deals bludgeoning damage and the effect gains the water trait, and a virga may changeling deals electricity damage.",
