    "sourceBlob": "a98e06f134248935b7dd9f3607d9f82c552b4cb7",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You're reduced to 0 Hit Points</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p>In the world of drama, the finale of any performance doesn't have to be the end, and for you, this now extends to life itself. When damage reduces you to 0 Hit Points, you can use this reaction to suddenly spring back into action. Instead of gaining the dying condition and falling @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Unconscious], you regain a number of Hit Points equal to @Damage[(10+@actor.level+@actor.system.abilities.con.mod)[healing]]{10 + your level + your Constitution modifier}.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Trigger You're reduced to 0 Hit Points Frequency once per day In the world of drama, the finale of any performance doesn't have to be the end, and for you, this now extends to life itself. When damage reduces you to 0 Hit Points, you can use this reaction to suddenly spring back into action. Instead of gaining the dying condition and falling Unconscious, you regain a number of Hit Points equal to 10 + your level + your Constitution modifier.",
