    "sourceBlob": "589d45fbdb98b1129d2c3f614c165e2a2b89b8bc",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An enemy reduces you to 0 Hit Points but doesn't kill you.</p><hr /><p>Your commitment to protecting others keeps you going, even against insurmountable odds. Instead of being knocked out, you're reduced to 1 Hit Point. You increase your @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Wounded] value by 1 and gain a number of temporary Hit Points equal to your level that last for 1 round.</p>",
