    "path": "packs/pf2e/feats/miscellaneous/deviant/kinetic-dampening.json",
    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/feats/miscellaneous/deviant/kinetic-dampening.json",
    "sourceBlob": "ca2a33788f3c3dc50af46792ce9e6616459064ad",
    "description": "<p>You feed off energy in your immediate surroundings, allowing you to dampen the force imparted by incoming blows. Until the beginning of your next turn, you gain resistance 5 to physical damage. At 10th level, and every 4 levels thereafter, the resistance increases by 5. Any blows that strike you during this time make no sound as their energy is drained.</p>\n<p><strong>Awakening</strong> You can extend your dampening field around you to create a safe haven for your allies. If you spend an additional action when using Kinetic Dampening, your field extends in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:15] around you. You can choose which creatures within the emanation are affected.</p>\n<p><strong>Awakening</strong> You dampen a greater variety of wavelengths. When you use this feat, you also gain resistance to your choice of fire, electricity, or sonic damage.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "You feed off energy in your immediate surroundings, allowing you to dampen the force imparted by incoming blows. Until the beginning of your next turn, you gain resistance 5 to physical damage. At 10th level, and every 4 levels thereafter, the resistance increases by 5. Any blows that strike you during this time make no sound as their energy is drained. Awakening You can extend your dampening field around you to create a safe haven for your allies. If you spend an additional action when using Kinetic Dampening, your field extends in a type:emanation area template distance 15 around you. You can choose which creatures within the emanation are affected. Awakening You dampen a greater variety of wavelengths. When you use this feat, you also gain resistance to your choice of fire, electricity, or sonic damage.",
