    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Access</strong> Vudrani ethnicity</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You roll a critical failure on a saving throw against an emotion effect.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You center yourself and call to mind the Vudrani monastic ideals of mindfulness and self-knowledge. You fail the save against the emotion effect instead of critically failing.</p>",
