    "sourceBlob": "d7e8495b977e43f14cbfae6ab17956283b364212",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You fail a skill check.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You feel a sense of deja vu when you've made a mistake, almost as if you weren't so careless in a past life and could certainly do better if given another chance. Reroll the triggering skill check and use the new result, even if it's worse than your first roll.</p>",
