    "sourceBlob": "96cda52d1ac47703e61b2827a6f40cc6e5592799",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per minute</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> Your turn begins.</p><hr /><p>You tap into the future to steal a bit of time from yourself a few seconds from now that you can use immediately. You become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Quickened] for 1 round, and can use the extra action to take any basic or specialty basic 1-action action. You gain this extra action immediately and can use it this turn. At the end of your turn, you become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Slowed]{Slowed 1} and are immune to the quickened condition until the end of your next turn.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Frequency once per minute Trigger Your turn begins. You tap into the future to steal a bit of time from yourself a few seconds from now that you can use immediately. You become Quickened for 1 round, and can use the extra action to take any basic or specialty basic 1-action action. You gain this extra action immediately and can use it this turn. At the end of your turn, you become Slowed 1 and are immune to the quickened condition until the end of your next turn.",
