    "sourceBlob": "fdb7580a2c7500d5c5bc210101d8a00b850c1b5a",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You and an adjacent creature are both on a narrow surface or uneven ground and the other creature is off-guard.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You shuffle your feet to dislodge the surface beneath you or otherwise cause your opponent to become unsteady. Attempt an @Check[acrobatics|defense:reflex] check against the adjacent creature's Reflex saving throw DC. On a success, the creature falls. On a critical failure, you fall.</p>",
