    "rarity": "common",
    "edition": "remaster",
    "publication": "Pathfinder Battlecry!",
    "path": "packs/pf2e/feats/archetype/guerrilla/level-14/lonely-army.json",
    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/feats/archetype/guerrilla/level-14/lonely-army.json",
    "sourceBlob": "b8d419da421e5521cd3980f668386c2538eaade2",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are in your favored location; you are currently @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Hidden], unobserved, or unnoticed by all enemies; and you are not @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Fatigued].</p><hr /><p>You move and attack with deadly silence, unbelievable speed, and unlimited ferocity. Strike with a blowgun or sling; if the Strike is successful, the enemy cannot tell where it came from and you remain hidden. Immediately after the successful Strike, you can @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Sneak] to a new location, Interact to reload a blowgun or sling, and Strike again, remaining hidden on a successful Strike. If the second Strike is successful, you can Sneak, Interact to reload, and then Strike with a sling or blowgun a third time, remaining hidden after a successful Strike.</p>\n<p>After using Lonely Army, you are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Fatigued] for 1 minute.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Requirements You are in your favored location; you are currently Hidden, unobserved, or unnoticed by all enemies; and you are not Fatigued. You move and attack with deadly silence, unbelievable speed, and unlimited ferocity. Strike with a blowgun or sling; if the Strike is successful, the enemy cannot tell where it came from and you remain hidden. Immediately after the successful Strike, you can Sneak to a new location, Interact to reload a blowgun or sling, and Strike again, remaining hidden on a successful Strike. If the second Strike is successful, you can Sneak, Interact to reload, and then Strike with a sling or blowgun a third time, remaining hidden after a successful Strike. After using Lonely Army, you are Fatigued for 1 minute.",
    "descriptionHash": "de38229613fae725f45b9f50a56aad005e778acaf2f54b7ab0bfa3e46263de61",
    "classification": "native-active",
    "classificationReason": "Native actionType action:3; animation follows this feat's own chat card.",
