    "sourceBlob": "5d8cf7fc1b49c632a8ba30ef9f4b1072a083def2",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Many flowers are beautiful to look upon but deadly to touch—and you're one of them. For 1 minute, any creature that touches you or damages you with a melee weapon without the reach trait or with a melee unarmed attack takes @Damage[3d6[poison]] damage.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Frequency once per day Many flowers are beautiful to look upon but deadly to touch—and you're one of them. For 1 minute, any creature that touches you or damages you with a melee weapon without the reach trait or with a melee unarmed attack takes damage poison damage.",
