    "sourceBlob": "5cef619acedba31b2e11ff5778adc56e54d5852b",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Your previous action was to Cast a Spell from a wizard spell slot, and the spell affected an ally within 60 feet.</p><hr /><p>As your spell takes hold on your ally, you use some of its magic to quickly dress their wounds. You use @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Battle Medicine] on one ally affected by the required spell. You do not need to be holding or wearing a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Healer's Toolkit], as you conjure glowing threads, bandages, or similar supplies out of pure magic, which adds the arcane trait to Battle Medicine.</p>",
