    "sourceBlob": "f69dbbc608c5d942ff078f44031d7a49f7775765",
    "description": "<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> or <span class=\"action-glyph\">3</span></p>\n<p>You shoot through the water at a great speed. Swim up to five times, or up to eight times if you used 3 actions. All this movement must be in a straight line (though the GM might allow reasonable variance). If you are moving up or down in this way, you aren't considered to be moving through difficult terrain while doing so.</p>",
