    "sourceBlob": "72d6e2139499301cf137f2b95d7b001d935d9b5e",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You succeed at a Demoralize check.</p><hr /><p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're wearing your <em>warmask</em>.</p><hr /><p>Your mask has grown into a manifestation of your pain, which you can release. The creature you successfully Demoralized takes @Damage[2d6[mental]] damage, or @Damage[4d6[mental]] damage if you're legendary in Intimidation. The target is then temporarily immune to additional damage from Mask of Pain for 24 hours.</p>",
