    "sourceBlob": "994e2732496019b9aeade54256757ed288ea71e3",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You fail a saving throw against an effect from your <em>warmask</em>'s magical tradition.</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're wearing your <em>warmask</em>.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Your <em>warmask</em> projects a white-hot fury that attempts to vaporize the offending magic. You reroll the triggering check with a +2 circumstance bonus, but you must use the new result, even if it's worse than your first roll.</p>",
