    "sourceBlob": "8f0428ac7c0f4930bcb27b3bf83fa2b58a79cac8",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per round</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You craft an @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Elixir of Life (Minor)]{Elixir of Life} using @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Quick Alchemy], and that elixir is at least 2 levels lower than your advanced alchemy level</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You mix a special additive into your elixir that calms the drinker's body and mind.</p>\n<p>The elixir of life attempts to counteract one fear effect or one effect imposing the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Paralyzed] condition on the drinker using the item's level and a counteract modifier equal to your class DC - 10.</p>",
