    "sourceBlob": "147164f63448be2965c8f55a5530b14687289542",
    "description": "<p>When you meet someone's gaze, they're unable to look away from you. Choose one target creature you can see and that can see you. That creature must succeed at a @Check[will|against:class-spell] save or be @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Fascinated] with you until the end of your next turn; the DC is the higher of your class DC or spell DC. If the creature succeeds at its save or its fascination ends due to a hostile action, it becomes temporarily immune to your Mesmerizing Gaze for 1 day.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "When you meet someone's gaze, they're unable to look away from you. Choose one target creature you can see and that can see you. That creature must succeed at a will check save or be Fascinated with you until the end of your next turn; the DC is the higher of your class DC or spell DC. If the creature succeeds at its save or its fascination ends due to a hostile action, it becomes temporarily immune to your Mesmerizing Gaze for 1 day.",
