    "publication": "Pathfinder Battlecry!",
    "path": "packs/pf2e/feats/class/guardian/level-4/not-so-fast.json",
    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/feats/class/guardian/level-4/not-so-fast.json",
    "sourceBlob": "040bd2e814b2921515ea98057f47208efe026d9b",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature within your reach leaves a square during a move action it's using.</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are in @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Hampering Stance].</p><hr /><p>You lash out when foes try to get past you, possibly stopping them in their tracks. Make a melee Strike against the triggering creature. The Strike gains the following additional results.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target's movement is disrupted.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes a –10-foot circumstance penalty to its Speed for the rest of its triggering movement. This penalty might cause the triggering creature's movement to end immediately based on its affected Speed.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> As success, but the target instead takes a –5-foot circumstance penalty to its Speed.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Trigger A creature within your reach leaves a square during a move action it's using. Requirements You are in Hampering Stance. You lash out when foes try to get past you, possibly stopping them in their tracks. Make a melee Strike against the triggering creature. The Strike gains the following additional results. Critical Success The target's movement is disrupted. Success The target takes a –10-foot circumstance penalty to its Speed for the rest of its triggering movement. This penalty might cause the triggering creature's movement to end immediately based on its affected Speed. Failure As success, but the target instead takes a –5-foot circumstance penalty to its Speed. Critical Failure The target is unaffected.",
