    "path": "packs/pf2e/feats/class/inventor/level-2/oil-fire.json",
    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/feats/class/inventor/level-2/oil-fire.json",
    "sourceBlob": "13b1f5dd5e5c3b93dcc9387379283931ac16f0f3",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You have a foe @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Grabbed].</p><hr /><p>Your armor includes flame-resistant gauntlets with oil-filled finger joints. These joints can split apart, dousing your opponent in flammable oil and then igniting it. The opponent must attempt a @Check[reflex|against:inventor] save against your class DC.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The grab ends.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The grab ends, and the target takes @Damage[1[persistent,fire]] damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes @Damage[(floor(@actor.level/2))[persistent,fire]] damage equal to half your level.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target takes @Damage[(@actor.level)[persistent,fire]] damage equal to your level.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Requirements You have a foe Grabbed. Your armor includes flame-resistant gauntlets with oil-filled finger joints. These joints can split apart, dousing your opponent in flammable oil and then igniting it. The opponent must attempt a reflex check save against your class DC. Critical Success The grab ends. Success The grab ends, and the target takes damage fire damage. Failure The target takes damage fire damage equal to half your level. Critical Failure The target takes damage fire damage equal to your level.",
    "descriptionHash": "afca12ecbb8d19fabffcacbea13460b15bf7aa878ac7e1f24e1e65dd43b37768",
