    "sourceBlob": "f8ab831ca3075e37b5a7d7403f7ae8e59b7039ec",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You are about to roll initiative.</p><hr /><p>You have a premonition about impending danger that you use to warn your allies. Each ally within 20 feet gains a +2 status bonus to their initiative roll and gains temporary Hit Points equal to half your level, which last for 1 minute. If you are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Cursebound]{Cursebound 2} when you use Oracular Warning, the bonus increases to +3, and if you are cursebound 3, the bonus increases to +4.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Oracular Warning]</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Trigger You are about to roll initiative. You have a premonition about impending danger that you use to warn your allies. Each ally within 20 feet gains a +2 status bonus to their initiative roll and gains temporary Hit Points equal to half your level, which last for 1 minute. If you are Cursebound 2 when you use Oracular Warning, the bonus increases to +3, and if you are cursebound 3, the bonus increases to +4. Effect: Oracular Warning",
