    "sourceBlob": "3c56d3f701a4f83472a3921ea086afc6b1069d10",
    "description": "<p>You have learned how to weigh down your enemies' life essence. If the next action you use is to Cast a Spell that targets a single creature, unless the target is unaffected by the spell, the target takes a –15-foot status penalty to its Speeds for 1 round (this penalty is doubled for climb, fly, and swim Speeds).</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Overburdening Spell]</p>",
