    "sourceBlob": "613e9d130c2636b9cbc0b4540860b5ebbb31c626",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p>Your dedication to the ideals of art and beauty allows your head gem to access the power of the waning moon. While you possess your head gem, you can overwhelm foes with a sense of reverent wonder. Enemies within a @Template[emanation|distance:15] must attempt a @Check[will|against:class-spell] save against the higher of your class DC or spell DC.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The enemy is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The enemy is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Fascinated] for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The enemy is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stunned]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The enemy is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Paralyzed] for 1 round.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Frequency once per day Your dedication to the ideals of art and beauty allows your head gem to access the power of the waning moon. While you possess your head gem, you can overwhelm foes with a sense of reverent wonder. Enemies within a emanation area template distance 15 must attempt a will check save against the higher of your class DC or spell DC. Critical Success The enemy is unaffected. Success The enemy is Fascinated for 1 round. Failure The enemy is Stunned 1. Critical Failure The enemy is Paralyzed for 1 round.",
