    "sourceBlob": "4cfdad89608c7790541c4bf2bfb9d34c8798b945",
    "description": "<p>Your enzymes can paralyze your foes rather than merely making it harder for them to heal their wounds. Strike with your claw or jaws. If you hit a living non-elf creature, it becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Paralyzed] unless it succeeds at a @Check[fortitude|against:class-spell] save against your class DC or spell DC, whichever is higher. Regardless of the result of the save, the creature is temporarily immune to Paralyzing Slash for 24 hours. A creature that becomes paralyzed can attempt a new save to end the paralysis at the end of each of its turns, and the DC cumulatively decreases by 1 on each such save.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Your enzymes can paralyze your foes rather than merely making it harder for them to heal their wounds. Strike with your claw or jaws. If you hit a living non-elf creature, it becomes Paralyzed unless it succeeds at a fortitude check save against your class DC or spell DC, whichever is higher. Regardless of the result of the save, the creature is temporarily immune to Paralyzing Slash for 24 hours. A creature that becomes paralyzed can attempt a new save to end the paralysis at the end of each of its turns, and the DC cumulatively decreases by 1 on each such save.",
    "descriptionHash": "0562d6b84766a4509dfc27074f0f50dbdd269b185cba07580cdb5451ff708efd",
