    "sourceBlob": "224990f4c1c9de4d951d4fb70c587c5f0da3bf9b",
    "description": "<p>You place a bit of magic in a physical projectile, causing it to fly in a runic pattern through the air once you loose it. Make a ranged Strike against a target within your weapon's first range increment. Because of the erratic nature of its flight, this Strike ignores any circumstance bonus to AC from cover. After your Strike, you can @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Trace Rune]{Trace a Rune} on one target in a straight line between you and the target of your Strike (including the original target).</p>",
