    "rarity": "common",
    "edition": "remaster",
    "publication": "Pathfinder Lost Omens Tian Xia Character Guide",
    "path": "packs/pf2e/feats/archetype/fan-dancer/peonys-flourish.json",
    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/feats/archetype/fan-dancer/peonys-flourish.json",
    "sourceBlob": "2dbd870421ed9c1eebd31f4f95c4971f0cd99cff",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're wielding two fans, one in each hand.</p><hr /><p>As you spin around and create wide arching circles with your fans, you manifest a mosaic of peonies that confuses your enemies. Stride twice and then attempt a @Check[performance|defense:will] check against the Will DC of each creature you passed adjacent to.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stunned]{Stunned 3} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Dazzled] for as long as they're stunned.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stunned]{Stunned 1} and dazzled for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is dazzled for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is unaffected and temporarily immune to further uses of Peony's Flourish for 24 hours.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Requirements You're wielding two fans, one in each hand. As you spin around and create wide arching circles with your fans, you manifest a mosaic of peonies that confuses your enemies. Stride twice and then attempt a performance check check against the Will DC of each creature you passed adjacent to. Critical Success The creature is Stunned 3 and Dazzled for as long as they're stunned. Success The creature is Stunned 1 and dazzled for 1 round. Failure The creature is dazzled for 1 round. Critical Failure The creature is unaffected and temporarily immune to further uses of Peony's Flourish for 24 hours.",
    "descriptionHash": "311869e3e32eb7acdfedcacebc651592a7aa5efa5042340bfc92ad0fed84cf59",
