    "rarity": "common",
    "edition": "remaster",
    "publication": "Pathfinder Player Core 2",
    "path": "packs/pf2e/feats/class/barbarian/level-18/perfect-clarity.json",
    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/feats/class/barbarian/level-18/perfect-clarity.json",
    "sourceBlob": "4684967b12bdd879afddfc14bf26f399dd9a339d",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You fail or critically fail an attack roll or Will save.</p><hr /><p>You burn out all your rage to ensure that your attack lands and your mind remains free. Reroll the triggering attack roll or Will save with a +2 circumstance bonus, and use the better result. You then immediately stop raging.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Trigger You fail or critically fail an attack roll or Will save. You burn out all your rage to ensure that your attack lands and your mind remains free. Reroll the triggering attack roll or Will save with a +2 circumstance bonus, and use the better result. You then immediately stop raging.",
