    "rarity": "uncommon",
    "edition": "legacy",
    "publication": "Pathfinder #149: Against the Scarlet Triad",
    "path": "packs/pf2e/feats/class/druid/level-12/pesh-skin.json",
    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/feats/class/druid/level-12/pesh-skin.json",
    "sourceBlob": "03a31dd0e564dc5ed8836a3ecefb56c482c66736",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are transformed into a plant by a polymorph spell.</p><hr /><p>Your plant form sprouts hundreds of spines, and your blood causes mild hallucinations in creatures exposed to it. Each time a creature touches you, hits you with an unarmed attack, or hits you with a melee weapon attack while adjacent to you, that creature takes @Damage[1d6[piercing]] damage. Increase the damage to @Damage[2d6[piercing]] if the polymorph spell is 8th rank or higher, or to @Damage[3d6[piercing]] if it's 10th rank.</p>\n<p>When an adjacent creature damages you with piercing or slashing damage, it must succeed at a @Check[fortitude|against:class|options:inflicts:stupefied] against your class DC or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stupefied]{Stupefied 1} (or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stupefied]{Stupefied 2} on a critical failure) until the end of its next turn.</p>\n<p>These benefits last until you're no longer polymorphed into a plant.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Requirements You are transformed into a plant by a polymorph spell. Your plant form sprouts hundreds of spines, and your blood causes mild hallucinations in creatures exposed to it. Each time a creature touches you, hits you with an unarmed attack, or hits you with a melee weapon attack while adjacent to you, that creature takes damage piercing damage. Increase the damage to damage piercing if the polymorph spell is 8th rank or higher, or to damage piercing if it's 10th rank. When an adjacent creature damages you with piercing or slashing damage, it must succeed at a fortitude check against your class DC or become Stupefied 1 (or Stupefied 2 on a critical failure) until the end of its next turn. These benefits last until you're no longer polymorphed into a plant.",
    "descriptionHash": "69c9b88c5895109e73817929829b3f485627b571616adbd51f6e43065a5c3f8e",
