    "sourceBlob": "23e5a7a3266f48ddc4e48886268ba7c410a508b8",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're wielding a loaded one-handed ranged weapon.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Your quick gestures and flair for performance distract your opponent, leaving it vulnerable to your follow-up attacks. You @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Feint] against an opponent within the required weapon's first range increment, rather than an opponent within melee reach. If you succeed, the foe is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] against your melee and ranged attacks, rather than only your melee attacks. On a critical failure, you're off-guard against the target's melee and ranged attacks, rather than only its melee attacks.</p>",
