    "sourceBlob": "1d7c1abeb1fb99112475a25bedca1c84c844b0e8",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You critically succeed on a Fortitude save against a poison effect.</p><hr /><p>You temporarily transform your digestive system to instead gain a burst of sustenance from the poison you ingest. You regain Hit Points equal to the level of the poison (or double the spell's rank if the poison was caused by a spell), and you gain as much nourishment as one square meal.</p>",
