    "publication": "Pathfinder Howl of the Wild",
    "path": "packs/pf2e/feats/class/witch/level-4/portents-of-the-haruspex.json",
    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/feats/class/witch/level-4/portents-of-the-haruspex.json",
    "sourceBlob": "9e5f10690074f93a406de19aed4649100d7f3ba1",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature within 30 feet is reduced to 0 Hit Points in a way that doesn't destroy their body.</p><hr /><p>Although the divinations of a haruspex traditionally require organs and lengthy interpretation, you've learned how to glimpse the future in a more simple fashion by reading creatures' wounds. The glimpse of the future gives guidance on what tools are best to use next. Roll [[/r 1d12]] to determine the damage type favored by your prediction. The next time before the end of your next turn that you or your allies deals that damage type to an enemy, that enemy has weakness equal to your level against that damage.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Portents of the Haruspex]</p><table class=\"pf2e remaster\"><thead><tr><th>D12</th><th>Damage Type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>acid</td></tr><tr><td>2-3</td><td>bludgeoning</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>cold</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>electricity</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>fire</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>mental</td></tr><tr><td>8-9</td><td>piercing</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>poison</td></tr><tr><td>11-12</td><td>slashing</td></tr></tbody></table>",
    "plainDescription": "Trigger A creature within 30 feet is reduced to 0 Hit Points in a way that doesn't destroy their body. Although the divinations of a haruspex traditionally require organs and lengthy interpretation, you've learned how to glimpse the future in a more simple fashion by reading creatures' wounds. The glimpse of the future gives guidance on what tools are best to use next. Roll [[/r 1d12]] to determine the damage type favored by your prediction. The next time before the end of your next turn that you or your allies deals that damage type to an enemy, that enemy has weakness equal to your level against that damage. Effect: Portents of the Haruspex D12 Damage Type 1 acid 2-3 bludgeoning 4 cold 5 electricity 6 fire 7 mental 8-9 piercing 10 poison 11-12 slashing",
    "descriptionHash": "a606037a2432efb50133f3d465ec6253d3b9454125ca8d413619ceaa12d0b216",
