    "sourceBlob": "a84dcb45fc9f1d01bc969590763fb886ad530062",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're unarmored or wearing light armor.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You have mastered the art of stalking your prey and striking when they are most vulnerable. You Stride and then Strike. If you began this action @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Hidden], you remain hidden until after the Strike. You can use Pounce Mimicry while Burrowing, Climbing, Flying, or Swimming instead of Striding if you have the corresponding movement type.</p>",
