    "sourceBlob": "e3a37da8e1e44fce218d6d5022908a64f6b22766",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are wielding a sawtooth saber in each hand.</p><hr /><p>You've mastered the signature assassination style of the Red Mantis. Attempt to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Feint] an enemy within 30 feet. If your Feint is successful, when you use Prayer Attack on subsequent turns you automatically make the target @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] against your melee attacks for that turn without rolling a check to Feint, so long as you remain visible to the target and the target remains within 30 feet of you. If you use your Prayer Attack against a different target, you must attempt to Feint the target normally.</p>\n<p>When you use Prayer Attack, your next successful Strike with a sawtooth saber that turn deals 2d6 persistent bleed damage to the target.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Requirements You are wielding a sawtooth saber in each hand. You've mastered the signature assassination style of the Red Mantis. Attempt to Feint an enemy within 30 feet. If your Feint is successful, when you use Prayer Attack on subsequent turns you automatically make the target Off Guard against your melee attacks for that turn without rolling a check to Feint, so long as you remain visible to the target and the target remains within 30 feet of you. If you use your Prayer Attack against a different target, you must attempt to Feint the target normally. When you use Prayer Attack, your next successful Strike with a sawtooth saber that turn deals 2d6 persistent bleed damage to the target.",
