    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per turn</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Your most recent action was to cast a non-cantrip divine spell.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You coat a weapon you're wielding in prayers and the divine power given to you by your deity. Until the end of your turn, the weapon deals an extra @Damage[1d6[vitality]] damage. As usual for vitality damage, this damage harms only undead and creatures with void healing.</p>",
