    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p><hr /><p>The spotlight should always be on you and you alone. Attempt a @Check[performance|defense:will] check against the Will DCs of all enemies within @Template[emanation|distance:30]{30 feet} who can see or hear you. On a success, the targets focus on you and gain a +1 circumstance bonus to hit you, but they're @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] to all creatures other than yourself. On a critical success, the effect lasts for 3 rounds.</p>",
