    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per turn</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You've replaced your heart with one made of animated quicksilver and living adamantine. You reduce your @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Slowed] condition by 1. Alternatively, if you are not slowed, you are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Quickened] during your next turn, and can use your extra action to Stride or Strike.</p>",
