    "publication": "Pathfinder Lost Omens Ancestry Guide",
    "path": "packs/pf2e/feats/ancestry/versatile-heritages/nephilim/radiate-glory.json",
    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/feats/ancestry/versatile-heritages/nephilim/radiate-glory.json",
    "sourceBlob": "1d748ff7aeeeba5980fdfc3bf4796cc25dc6e83f",
    "description": "<p>Your inherent glory radiates into the world with all the divine power of the celestial planes for 1 minute.</p>\n<p>Any creature that can see you while you Radiate Glory must attempt a @Check[will|against:class-spell] saving throw against your class or spell DC, whichever is higher. The creature then becomes temporarily immune to this effect for 24 hours.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> You are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Concealed] to the creature for 1 round by the shining light, but can't use this concealment to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Hide], as normal for when your location is obvious.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> As success, except you are concealed to the creature while your glory radiates.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> You are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Hidden] to the creature while your glory radiates, lost amid the radiant corona of your presence. Your general position is still obvious, so you can't use this to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Sneak].</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Your inherent glory radiates into the world with all the divine power of the celestial planes for 1 minute. Any creature that can see you while you Radiate Glory must attempt a will check saving throw against your class or spell DC, whichever is higher. The creature then becomes temporarily immune to this effect for 24 hours. Critical Success The creature is unaffected. Success You are Concealed to the creature for 1 round by the shining light, but can't use this concealment to Hide, as normal for when your location is obvious. Failure As success, except you are concealed to the creature while your glory radiates. Critical Failure You are Hidden to the creature while your glory radiates, lost amid the radiant corona of your presence. Your general position is still obvious, so you can't use this to Sneak.",
    "descriptionHash": "8e32f7e10f7f56728e38d1843dd0a52dd2727ec2a258e60863665a25ba152945",
