    "sourceBlob": "ddd6a5f37bdbfb33a97e2e9f9781593828f87672",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An adjacent creature you can see fails an attack roll against you.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You dart away from your foe's attack with a casual laugh, using the opening to cause mischief. You attempt to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Steal] an item from the triggering creature, ignoring the usual restriction that the creature can't be in combat.</p>",
