    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You blind or dazzle a creature.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You've spent considerable time practicing the manipulation of light, weaponizing your blade's reflection or bolstering the luminosity of magical displays to unconventional heights. Extend the duration of the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Blinded] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Dazzled] condition you give the target by 1 round.</p>",
