    "sourceBlob": "87f083677db74c68b11b58845b6e0a6e6c91fde6",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You roll initiative.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Rebellions require an intricate knowledge of one's surroundings—because you might need to escape at any moment. You remember the locations of escape routes, ambush spots, and cover from a scouting expedition or a previous visit to the area. Roll a [[/r 1d20]]{d20}. At any point during the subsequent combat, you can substitute the result of this roll instead of rolling a d20 on one Deception check to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Create a Diversion] or on one Stealth check to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Hide].</p>",
