    "sourceBlob": "7869f02b7b150ba31ad50867d3a3c6cf41e172db",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You miss with your Strike during @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Channel Smite].</p>\n<hr />\n<p>The energy from your smite persists for a moment, allowing you to pass it to a new target. Cast the 1-action version of the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Harm] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Heal] spell you expended, targeting a creature other than the target of your Strike.</p>",
