    "sourceBlob": "e7f233dbd8177bdd8835c3d34df7ba55ca594e24",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per 10 minutes</p><hr /><p>You use your thralls to restore yourself. Destroy up to three of your thralls within 60 feet and regain @Damage[(@actor.level)[healing]]{Hit Points equal to your level} per thrall destroyed. If you destroy three thralls total, you can also decrease one of your @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Clumsy], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Enfeebled], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Sickened], or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stupefied] condition values by 1.</p>",
