    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're wielding a harpoon, a spear weapon, or a net attached to a rope.</p><hr /><p>You've developed combat techniques inspired by the methods fishermen use to catch large fish. Make a Strike with a required weapon or [[/act grapple]] with a net. If the attack hits, you can attempt an @Check[athletics|against:fortitude] check against the target's Fortitude DC. On a success, you pull the target 10 feet closer to you.</p>",
