    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per 10 minutes</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature within 30 feet of you targets you, and you can see the attacker.</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are in dim or bright light.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Your body's natural luster has been polished to a gleaming shine. You use this to reflect light back into your enemy's eyes, disrupting its aim and focus; it must succeed at a Reflex save against your class DC or be @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Dazzled] until the end of your next turn.</p>",
