    "sourceBlob": "41a3dcc83dd56627c56788b2fc36cca14d9c8532",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are under the effects of a mutagen.</p><hr /><p>You redirect a mutagen within your body to spit a stream of stomach acid at a foe. A creature within 30 feet takes 1d6 acid damage for every 2 levels you have (@Damage[(floor(@actor.level/2))d6[acid]]), with a @Check[reflex|against:alchemist|basic] save against your class DC. On a failure, the creature is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 1} (or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 2} on a critical failure). The mutagen's duration immediately ends.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Requirements You are under the effects of a mutagen. You redirect a mutagen within your body to spit a stream of stomach acid at a foe. A creature within 30 feet takes 1d6 acid damage for every 2 levels you have (damage acid), with a reflex check save against your class DC. On a failure, the creature is also Sickened 1 (or Sickened 2 on a critical failure). The mutagen's duration immediately ends.",
