    "rarity": "common",
    "edition": "remaster",
    "publication": "Pathfinder War of Immortals",
    "path": "packs/pf2e/feats/archetype/broken-chain/release-me.json",
    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/feats/archetype/broken-chain/release-me.json",
    "sourceBlob": "c2ee78550f835802273a9598897983afe1daa1c8",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> An enemy has you @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Grabbed] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Restrained].</p><hr /><p>Your retribution against one who would detain you is swift and dangerous. Make a melee Strike against the creature who has you @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Grabbed] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Restrained]. You can still make this attack even if you are restrained, though not if you are wielding a two-handed weapon. Unless your Strike is a critical failure, you can then attempt a check to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Escape]. If the creature who has you grabbed or restrained is the target of your @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Ultimatum of Liberation], you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to this check. Both the Strike and the Escape count toward your multiple attack penalty, but it doesn't increase until you've made both rolls.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Requirements An enemy has you Grabbed or Restrained. Your retribution against one who would detain you is swift and dangerous. Make a melee Strike against the creature who has you Grabbed or Restrained. You can still make this attack even if you are restrained, though not if you are wielding a two-handed weapon. Unless your Strike is a critical failure, you can then attempt a check to Escape. If the creature who has you grabbed or restrained is the target of your Ultimatum of Liberation, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to this check. Both the Strike and the Escape count toward your multiple attack penalty, but it doesn't increase until you've made both rolls.",
    "descriptionHash": "98fddc318e4444d7d19b485064e04a02250ad741f3ecfd17a661da22bbd088d0",
