    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/feats/class/animist/level-1/relinquish-control.json",
    "sourceBlob": "a6eb1cf0a78d80ea7f68df5baf1f240d57b07c50",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> Your turn begins.</p><hr /><p>Your apparition takes over and shields you from outside influence. Until the start of your next turn, you gain a +4 status bonus on saves against spells and effects that give you the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Controlled] condition or attempt to influence your actions (such as @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Charm], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Command], or a nosoi's haunting melody). However, the only actions you can take are to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Recall Knowledge], Step, Strike, Cast an apparition Spell, Cast a vessel Spell, Sustain a vessel spell, or use an action that has the apparition trait. You gain a +2 circumstance bonus on all Recall Knowledge checks made using Lore skills granted by your attuned apparitions.</p><hr /><p><strong>Special</strong> This feat requires a particularly strong bond with a specific apparition to learn. Choose one apparition you have access to; once you learn this feat, you must always choose that apparition as one of the apparitions you attune to each day.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Trigger Your turn begins. Your apparition takes over and shields you from outside influence. Until the start of your next turn, you gain a +4 status bonus on saves against spells and effects that give you the Controlled condition or attempt to influence your actions (such as Charm, Command, or a nosoi's haunting melody). However, the only actions you can take are to Recall Knowledge, Step, Strike, Cast an apparition Spell, Cast a vessel Spell, Sustain a vessel spell, or use an action that has the apparition trait. You gain a +2 circumstance bonus on all Recall Knowledge checks made using Lore skills granted by your attuned apparitions. Special This feat requires a particularly strong bond with a specific apparition to learn. Choose one apparition you have access to; once you learn this feat, you must always choose that apparition as one of the apparitions you attune to each day.",
