    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p>\n<hr />\n<p>If your next action is to use your divine font to cast a 3-action @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Heal] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Harm] spell, you can harness the residual energy to counterbalance opposing forces. In addition to its normal effects, you use your <em>heal</em> or <em>harm</em> spell to attempt to counteract one divine effect in the spell's area.</p>",
