    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per 10 minutes</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> Another creature within 30 feet of you that can see you would gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened] condition.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You give a target a stern glower to remind them that it is you, and no one else, they should truly fear. Reduce the value of the frightened condition the creature would take by 1.</p>",
