    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per 10 minutes</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An enemy targets you with a spell attack or other magical attack against your AC.</p><hr /><p>You attempt to deconstruct an incoming spell into its individual magical components, storing them temporarily as a rune. You gain a +4 circumstance bonus to AC against the triggering attack. If the attack misses, the spell becomes sealed in a rune, which floats around you. Until the end of your next turn, you can @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Trace Rune]{Trace} this Rune onto a creature as normal. This rune doesn't have an effect until it's invoked. When the rune is invoked, the rune-bearer is affected by the spell or magical attack captured in the rune. Make a check, using your class DC – 10 as the modifier against the rune-bearer's AC to determine the effects.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Frequency once per 10 minutes Trigger An enemy targets you with a spell attack or other magical attack against your AC. You attempt to deconstruct an incoming spell into its individual magical components, storing them temporarily as a rune. You gain a +4 circumstance bonus to AC against the triggering attack. If the attack misses, the spell becomes sealed in a rune, which floats around you. Until the end of your next turn, you can Trace this Rune onto a creature as normal. This rune doesn't have an effect until it's invoked. When the rune is invoked, the rune-bearer is affected by the spell or magical attack captured in the rune. Make a check, using your class DC – 10 as the modifier against the rune-bearer's AC to determine the effects.",
