    "sourceBlob": "154a69563303ae394fcb036289a83097661270bd",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're in Anchor Stance, and your target is within 5 feet of the edge of a water vehicle or already in the water.</p><hr /><p>You swirl water around you to make a current that pulls creatures closer. Attempt an @Check[athletics|against:fortitude|options:forced-movement] check against the Fortitude DC of a creature within 20 feet. If the creature is willing, you increase your degree of success by one (turning a failure into a success and a success into a critical success).</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is pulled 10 feet toward you.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is pulled 5 feet toward you.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> Your movements cause you to be @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] until the beginning of your next turn.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Requirements You're in Anchor Stance, and your target is within 5 feet of the edge of a water vehicle or already in the water. You swirl water around you to make a current that pulls creatures closer. Attempt an athletics check check against the Fortitude DC of a creature within 20 feet. If the creature is willing, you increase your degree of success by one (turning a failure into a success and a success into a critical success). Critical Success The target is pulled 10 feet toward you. Success The target is pulled 5 feet toward you. Critical Failure Your movements cause you to be Off Guard until the beginning of your next turn.",
    "descriptionHash": "9a16c14307bba3a73dc10af0cfb7cda296133a98e82070f861e7c7d2cf941672",
    "classification": "native-active",
