    "rarity": "common",
    "edition": "remaster",
    "publication": "Pathfinder Rage of Elements",
    "path": "packs/pf2e/feats/class/kineticist/level-6/roiling-mudslide.json",
    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/feats/class/kineticist/level-6/roiling-mudslide.json",
    "sourceBlob": "8dec021630f19a2b696022daf953c053bc5364e7",
    "description": "<p>You form water and earth into a mudslide that smashes your opponents and coats them in mud. Each creature in a @Template[cone|distance:30] takes @Damage[(floor((@actor.level -6)/4)+2)d8[bludgeoning]|options:area-damage] damage with a @Check[fortitude|against:kineticist|basic|options:area-effect] save against your class DC. A creature that fails is also pushed 5 feet (or 10 feet on a critical failure) and coated in mud until the end of its next turn. While coated in mud, the creature falls @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Prone] at the end of its movement any time it ends a move action other than a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Crawl] or Step. The creature can attempt an Acrobatics check or @Check[reflex|against:kineticist] save against your class DC, avoiding the fall if it succeeds.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Level (+4)</strong> The damage increases by 1d8.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "You form water and earth into a mudslide that smashes your opponents and coats them in mud. Each creature in a cone area template distance 30 takes damage bludgeoning damage with a fortitude check save against your class DC. A creature that fails is also pushed 5 feet (or 10 feet on a critical failure) and coated in mud until the end of its next turn. While coated in mud, the creature falls Prone at the end of its movement any time it ends a move action other than a Crawl or Step. The creature can attempt an Acrobatics check or reflex check save against your class DC, avoiding the fall if it succeeds. Level (+4) The damage increases by 1d8.",
