    "sourceBlob": "4da508b51629967d0d1e63c64f2c4288c9ed2565",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p><hr /><p>You call upon your deity to grant you their protective blessing. Attempt a @Check[religion|dc:30|immutable:true|showDC:all] check. If you have legendary proficiency in Religion, you can instead attempt a @Check[religion|dc:40|immutable:true|showDC:all] check to increase the temporary Hit Points you gain on a successful check to 15 (25 on a critical success).</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> You gain 10 temporary Hit Points. You lose any remaining temporary Hit Points after 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> You gain 5 temporary Hit Points. You lose any remaining temporary Hit Points after 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> Your deity withholds their blessing. You cannot attempt to call to your deity again for 1 day.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Frequency once per hour You call upon your deity to grant you their protective blessing. Attempt a religion check check. If you have legendary proficiency in Religion, you can instead attempt a religion check check to increase the temporary Hit Points you gain on a successful check to 15 (25 on a critical success). Critical Success You gain 10 temporary Hit Points. You lose any remaining temporary Hit Points after 1 minute. Success You gain 5 temporary Hit Points. You lose any remaining temporary Hit Points after 1 minute. Critical Failure Your deity withholds their blessing. You cannot attempt to call to your deity again for 1 day.",
