    "sourceBlob": "c516f3fd94cb02d81be386c9387003293865faf9",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're wielding two weapons, at least one of which is a sawtooth saber.</p><hr /><p>Your sawtooth saber training enables you to pin down an enemy using your twin blades. Make a Strike with each weapon against the same creature. If you deal sneak attack damage, you can immediately attempt to [[/act grapple]] the creature, even if you don't have a hand free. If you dealt damage with both Strikes, your multiple attack penalty is not applied to the Grapple attempt.</p>",
