    "sourceBlob": "b6f5402c2a7898c72b0bdb9fec4883972586bdef",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An enemy within your reach targets you with a melee attack, and you're aware of the attack.</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're in @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Twisting Petal Stance].</p><hr /><p>You evade an incoming attack by twisting your enemy's tactics in your favor. You gain a +2 circumstance bonus to AC against the triggering attack. If the attack misses you, you can immediately attempt a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Feint] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Shove] against the triggering attacker; if you roll a success, you get a critical success instead.</p>",
