    "description": "<p>With a flex of your mighty thews and a guttural bellow that can make ears bleed, you drive back any enemies surrounding you. Each enemy within a @Template[type:emanation|distance:10] must attempt a @Check[fortitude|against:class|options:area-effect] saving throw against your class DC.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is pushed 5 feet away from you.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is pushed 10 feet away from you and takes @Damage[8d6[sonic]|options:area-damage] damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is pushed 15 feet away from you and takes @Damage[16d6[sonic]|options:area-damage] damage.</p>",
