    "sourceBlob": "9abb42bbd8b84476b26db3e5a6cb1e97b2e3f4c7",
    "description": "<p>You drop your disguise at the right moment and surprise your target. After you @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Impersonate] someone else using a disguise kit, you can remove your disguise with a dramatic gesture. Any creatures that previously failed to see through your disguise are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] against the next attack you make before the end of your turn.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "You drop your disguise at the right moment and surprise your target. After you Impersonate someone else using a disguise kit, you can remove your disguise with a dramatic gesture. Any creatures that previously failed to see through your disguise are Off Guard against the next attack you make before the end of your turn.",
