    "sourceBlob": "4cd7f1468934c05f4d2af1a488523bf55f937fda",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You deal damage to a living creature with your fist Strike or with Desiccating Inhalation.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You draw the moisture you've drained from others into your own flesh, temporarily taking on the appearance of life. This has the effects of @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Illusory Disguise], except you can appear only as yourself while you were a living humanoid.</p>",
