    "sourceBlob": "c1c882edb50e1832b06365154cbb4927fa682b5e",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> A @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened] creature is in your melee reach.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Your offense exploits your enemy's fear. Make a melee Strike against a frightened creature. If you hit and deal damage, the target becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] until its frightened condition ends. If the target was already off-guard to you when you damaged it with this Strike, it can't reduce its frightened value below 1 until the start of your next turn.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Requirements A Frightened creature is in your melee reach. Your offense exploits your enemy's fear. Make a melee Strike against a frightened creature. If you hit and deal damage, the target becomes Off Guard until its frightened condition ends. If the target was already off-guard to you when you damaged it with this Strike, it can't reduce its frightened value below 1 until the start of your next turn.",
