    "sourceBlob": "27164939b75115d1190cfaec11385724c105c780",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Grabbed].</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You have a fully grown tail.</p><hr /><p>You can shed a portion of your tail to escape. You cease being grabbed, then Stride without triggering any reactions from the creature that grabbed you. It takes 1 day for your tail to fully grow back. Until it does, you can't use your tail unarmed attack, and you take a –2 circumstance penalty on checks to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Balance].</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Trigger You become Grabbed. Requirements You have a fully grown tail. You can shed a portion of your tail to escape. You cease being grabbed, then Stride without triggering any reactions from the creature that grabbed you. It takes 1 day for your tail to fully grow back. Until it does, you can't use your tail unarmed attack, and you take a –2 circumstance penalty on checks to Balance.",
