    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p><hr /><p>You and those closest to you are protected by your deity's power. For 1 minute, you and all allies within 10 feet of you gain a +1 item bonus to AC and resistance 10 to spirit damage. In addition, when a creature adjacent to you hits you with a melee attack, or when a creature touches you or hits you with an unarmed attack, that creature takes @Damage[(ternary(gte(@actor.level,20),10,5))[spirit]] damage.</p>\n<p>At 20th level, the spirit resistance increases to 15 and the spirit damage increases to 10.</p>",
