    "sourceBlob": "e2d99dd65f1f466ed9af1914b87be5cb6c708b0d",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per 10 minutes</p><hr /><p>Other casters' never-ending hunger for new magic prevents them from truly understanding just how far simple magic can be pushed when truly mastered. If your next action is to Cast a spell you prepared from your keepsake, you Cast the Spell as though it is 1 rank higher, up to the highest rank spell you can cast.</p>",
