    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You currently have a fly Speed.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You can now achieve such flight speeds that your passage splits the very air. Fly twice. Any creature that is adjacent to you at any point during your movement takes @Damage[10d6[sonic]] damage (@Check[fortitude|against:class|basic] save against your class DC). On a critical failure, the creature is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Deafened] for 1 hour.</p>",
