    "sourceBlob": "9dddf4ae77b67b4de9696ef598a95d32ff6ff082",
    "description": "<p>Your spell shrouds you in a billowing cloud. If your next action is to Cast a Spell that targets you, you surround yourself in a @Template[emanation|distance:15] of dense magical mist that lasts until the start of your next turn. All creatures within the cloud become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Concealed], and all creatures outside the cloud are concealed to creatures within it.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Your spell shrouds you in a billowing cloud. If your next action is to Cast a Spell that targets you, you surround yourself in a emanation area template distance 15 of dense magical mist that lasts until the start of your next turn. All creatures within the cloud become Concealed, and all creatures outside the cloud are concealed to creatures within it.",
