    "sourceBlob": "d21c568b46a65548ce1d1addfe8cb6d406ea6a2f",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You have a creature @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Grabbed] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Restrained].</p><hr /><p>You squeeze your opponent in a vicious bear hug, putting intense pressure on their nerves, joints, or other pain points. Attempt an Athletics check to [[/act grapple]] a creature you have grabbed or restrained, with the following additional effects if you succeed.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Clumsy]{Clumsy 2} until the end of its next turn and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Clumsy]{Clumsy 1} for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is clumsy 1 until the end of its next turn.</p>",
