    "sourceBlob": "f1d8dd70d9138c28d1ac11272ef061b34aa5df79",
    "description": "<p><strong>Cost</strong> 1 spirit wisp or spirit remnant from your spirit dwelling</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are holding your spirit dwelling.</p><hr /><p>You purify a spirit by absolving it of its sins and regrets. This cathartic experience restores your Hit Points or those of an adjacent ally. If you expend a spirit wisp, the target recovers @Damage[(@actor.level)d4[healing,vitality]] Hit Points. If you expend a spirit remnant, the target recovers 1d6 Hit Points per level of the incorporeal undead or haunt from which you gained the remnant.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Cost 1 spirit wisp or spirit remnant from your spirit dwelling Requirements You are holding your spirit dwelling. You purify a spirit by absolving it of its sins and regrets. This cathartic experience restores your Hit Points or those of an adjacent ally. If you expend a spirit wisp, the target recovers damage healing vitality Hit Points. If you expend a spirit remnant, the target recovers 1d6 Hit Points per level of the incorporeal undead or haunt from which you gained the remnant.",
