    "sourceBlob": "9e273f4d35d3a6a52a1502a295104b32713db584",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're riding a megafauna companion that has a melee Strike.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You've trained your megafauna companion to stagger its enemies, impeding their ability to fight back. You @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Command an Animal] to order your megafauna companion to spend both its actions making a single, powerful Strike. The attack deals an extra die of weapon damage, and if the attack hits and deals damage, the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Slowed]{Slowed 1} until the end of its next turn.</p>",
