    "path": "packs/pf2e/feats/ancestry/centaur/level-17/starshot-arrow.json",
    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/feats/ancestry/centaur/level-17/starshot-arrow.json",
    "sourceBlob": "cf402669fa9319c71b7f68a5bb284a2a506c9bf6",
    "description": "<p>The greatest centaurs need not wait until their stories are over to touch the stars in the sky. You draw an arrow (or other ammunition), whisper a short invocation over it, and then Strike with a ranged weapon. The arrow becomes a bolt of starlight, changing its damage to your choice of force or spirit and granting it the effects of the <em>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Ghost Touch]</em> rune. When the arrow Strikes its target, it unravels into a constellation of starlight that wraps around the target's limbs, imposing a –10-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds for [[/r 2d4 #Starshot Arrow Duration]]{2d4 rounds} or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Immobilized]{Immobilizing} it if the Strike was a critical hit. The target can untangle itself by spending an Interact action to break free.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Starshot Arrow]</p>",
    "plainDescription": "The greatest centaurs need not wait until their stories are over to touch the stars in the sky. You draw an arrow (or other ammunition), whisper a short invocation over it, and then Strike with a ranged weapon. The arrow becomes a bolt of starlight, changing its damage to your choice of force or spirit and granting it the effects of the Ghost Touch rune. When the arrow Strikes its target, it unravels into a constellation of starlight that wraps around the target's limbs, imposing a –10-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds for [[/r 2d4 #Starshot Arrow Duration]]{2d4 rounds} or Immobilizing it if the Strike was a critical hit. The target can untangle itself by spending an Interact action to break free. Effect: Starshot Arrow",
    "descriptionHash": "dd0b2ec89c203342e7e5a12bd5fdfcb8cc13e1a4bd1535ded668f51180204285",
    "classification": "native-active",
    "classificationReason": "Native actionType action:1; animation follows this feat's own chat card.",
