    "sourceBlob": "0fdcc2dde228a12b943159357f362ee057277fd3",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are wielding a piercing or slashing melee weapon.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You dart towards your opponent, seeking to stab them and slice their purse-strings with a single movement. Stride up to your Speed; this movement does not trigger reactions triggered by movement. At any point during this movement you can Strike an opponent within reach. If this Strike is successful, you can attempt a Thievery check to Steal from the target.</p>",
