    "sourceBlob": "ce86a5a9e68bcc0d32f49685756435bfca90ef1b",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An opponent adjacent to you critically hits you with a melee weapon or melee unarmed attack.</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You have at least 1 available Focus Point.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You lash out, directing a burst of storming fury toward a creature that has harmed you. You cast @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Tempest Surge] on the triggering opponent and push that creature, moving it 5 feet away from you if it fails its Reflex save, or 10 feet if it critically fails. This movement is forced movement.</p>",
