    "path": "packs/pf2e/feats/archetype/drake-rider/strafing-breath.json",
    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/feats/archetype/drake-rider/strafing-breath.json",
    "sourceBlob": "21e740664faaf1f43fc621cc738f9e44e80868af",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.War Rider Stance] is active.</p><hr /><p>You urge your dragon mount forward, wreathed in magical power. Your mount Strides three times. If your mount has a fly Speed, it can substitute a Fly action for any of these Stride actions. As it moves, your dragon companion's magical breath billows around you. The aura from War Rider Stance increases to a @Template[type:emanation|distance:10] during this movement, and each creature that's in the emanation at any point during your movement takes the damage from it (with the normal save). A creature can take damage only once, even if you move past it multiple times.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Requirements War Rider Stance is active. You urge your dragon mount forward, wreathed in magical power. Your mount Strides three times. If your mount has a fly Speed, it can substitute a Fly action for any of these Stride actions. As it moves, your dragon companion's magical breath billows around you. The aura from War Rider Stance increases to a type:emanation area template distance 10 during this movement, and each creature that's in the emanation at any point during your movement takes the damage from it (with the normal save). A creature can take damage only once, even if you move past it multiple times.",
