    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You have a creature @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Grabbed] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Restrained].</p><hr /><p>Your iron grip saps your opponent's strength. Attempt an Athletics check to [[/act grapple]] the creature you have grabbed or restrained, with the following additional effects if you succeed.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Enfeebled]{Enfeebled 2} until the end of its next turn and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Enfeebled]{Enfeebled 1} for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is enfeebled 1 until the end of its next turn.</p>",
