    "sourceBlob": "b438d3e69f724b66c7e2be1c4b72bf5e4b26c67f",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You would die.</p><hr /><p>In a final gambit, you fill yourself with umbral energy in a gruesome display of shadowy tentacle that disquiets all but the hardiest foes. You remain conscious and regain @Damage[6d8[healing]] Hit Points. Each enemy creature that can see you must succeed at a @Check[will|against:spell] save against your spell DC or be @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 2}; this is a fear and visual effect.</p>",
