    "sourceBlob": "5dfe26ac72a9bf0510ff87a1ba84299fbb557366",
    "description": "<p>With a quick sprint, you dash up to your foe and swing. Stride twice. If you end your movement within melee reach of at least one enemy, you can make a melee Strike against that enemy. You can use Sudden Charge while Burrowing, Climbing, Flying, or Swimming instead of Striding if you have the corresponding movement type.</p>",
