    "path": "packs/pf2e/feats/archetype/winged-warrior/sunbird-glare.json",
    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/feats/archetype/winged-warrior/sunbird-glare.json",
    "sourceBlob": "720390b01244784e988c5dc75dfab8b4b592fe35",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're in bright light.</p><hr /><p>By keeping your feathers clean and sleek, you can catch the light across your wings to create a startling glare in the eyes of a creature within 20 feet. The target must succeed at a @Check[fortitude|against:class] save against your class DC or be @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Dazzled] for 1 round (1 minute on a critical failure). Regardless of their result, the target is temporarily immune to Sunbird Glare for 10 minutes.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Requirements You're in bright light. By keeping your feathers clean and sleek, you can catch the light across your wings to create a startling glare in the eyes of a creature within 20 feet. The target must succeed at a fortitude check save against your class DC or be Dazzled for 1 round (1 minute on a critical failure). Regardless of their result, the target is temporarily immune to Sunbird Glare for 10 minutes.",
    "descriptionHash": "2895a76fcd0be915a8267fff2e6d83df825b02f4e1cf9cd9131e03371382de1e",
    "classification": "native-active",
