    "sourceBlob": "b2c5d463c8359d3b0d716be24d1539b4c75fac58",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p><hr /><p>Whether in the salon or on the street, you've captured the attention of everyone around you. In this moment, they're all hanging on your next word or anticipating your next move. You capture the moment by striking an unforgettable pose, one that your friends find alluring and your foes find alarming. Roll a Diplomacy or Intimidation check. You can substitute the result of this check for one Reflex save you would be required to attempt in the next minute.</p>",
