    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature who isn't, to your knowledge, tied to any of your active investigations takes a hostile action against you in combat.</p><hr /><p>Sometimes something intrudes upon your case unexpectedly, such as an ambush sent to bring your investigation to a close. You use @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Person of Interest] against the triggering creature. This doesn't allow you to use Person of Interest more frequently than normal.</p>",
