    "sourceBlob": "d764df89bf8efb1a2a9bb3d3a7e057c0987faf43",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You critically hit a creature that is not on its home plane.</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You have a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Banishment] spell prepared.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>The force of your blow sends your victim back to its home plane. You expend a <em>banishment</em> spell you have prepared, affecting the creature you critically hit without needing to cast the spell. The creature can attempt to resist the spell as normal.</p>",
