    "sourceBlob": "d33f86891a5c65b17cad5a5268c50c91cad0197a",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Grabbed] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Restrained] by a creature.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>When you wriggle free from an enemy's grasp, you take something of theirs with you. You attempt to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Escape] from being grabbed or restrained by a creature. If you succeed, you can also attempt to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Steal] from the creature, even if the creature is in combat.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Requirements You're Grabbed or Restrained by a creature. When you wriggle free from an enemy's grasp, you take something of theirs with you. You attempt to Escape from being grabbed or restrained by a creature. If you succeed, you can also attempt to Steal from the creature, even if the creature is in combat.",
