    "description": "<p>You slam your hands together to unleash a deafening blast. Creatures in a @Template[cone|distance:15] cone take @Damage[(max(3,floor(@actor.level/2)))d6[sonic]|options:area-damage] damage, with a @Check[fortitude|against:class|basic|options:area-effect] against your class DC. Creatures that critically fail their save are also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Deafened] for 1 minute. You can't use this ability again for [[/r 1d4 #Recharge Thunder Clap]]{1d4 rounds} as your hands recover from the thunderous vibrations.</p>\n<p>At 8th level, and every 2 levels thereafter, the damage from Thunder Clap increases by 1d6.</p>",
