    "sourceBlob": "ec1e7ba59b0611081388806369f148bcbada2d12",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> Your size increases due to a polymorph effect.</p><hr /><p>The physical growth of your transformation is a spectacle that shakes foes to their core. Each enemy smaller than your new size within 30 feet of you must attempt a @Check[will|against:class-spell|options:area-effect,inflicts:frightened] save against your class DC or spell DC, whichever is higher.</p><hr /><p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 2}, and you can push it up to 10 feet from you. This is forced movement.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Trigger Your size increases due to a polymorph effect. The physical growth of your transformation is a spectacle that shakes foes to their core. Each enemy smaller than your new size within 30 feet of you must attempt a will check save against your class DC or spell DC, whichever is higher. Success The creature is unaffected. Failure The creature becomes Frightened 1. Critical Failure The creature becomes Frightened 2, and you can push it up to 10 feet from you. This is forced movement.",
