    "sourceBlob": "fe59701e5c5021f13f002742518c4fc4d907ba37",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Your senses are so sharp they pierce through all illusions. You can heighten your senses to non-magically gain the effects of a 6th-rank @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Truesight] spell for 10 minutes. The ability to \"see through\" illusions and polymorph effects applies to any precise sense you possess.</p>",
