    "sourceBlob": "99015841bb9765cb64b8c89b260662f926452ec9",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're wielding a fan.</p><hr /><p>Your fans, one raised up alongside your head and the other alongside your hip, become a blur as you twirl across the battlefield. Attempt to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Tumble Through] an enemy's space using [[/act tumble-through skill=performance]]{Performance}; on a success, you can make a melee Strike against the enemy with a fan you're wielding at any point during the movement. On a critical success, the enemy is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] against this attack.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Requirements You're wielding a fan. Your fans, one raised up alongside your head and the other alongside your hip, become a blur as you twirl across the battlefield. Attempt to Tumble Through an enemy's space using [[/act tumble-through skill=performance]]{Performance}; on a success, you can make a melee Strike against the enemy with a fan you're wielding at any point during the movement. On a critical success, the enemy is Off Guard against this attack.",
    "descriptionHash": "96247f83cd12cabadc24dbf884c322b2913373b01c522197120ab222cf27ab40",
