    "description": "<p>You capitalize on the distraction provided by an ally. You [[/act sneak options=underhanded-assault]] up to a foe adjacent to one of your allies. You can roll against the foe you're Sneaking up on, even if it's currently observing you, as though you were @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Hidden]. You take a –2 penalty on your Stealth check. If your Stealth check against the chosen foe succeeds, you can make a melee Strike against that foe at the end of your Sneak.</p>",
