    "sourceBlob": "c677e358e0148f52a35ca8e02374623abc11a8b5",
    "description": "<p>Your runes act as beacons for your arrows and bolts. Make a ranged Strike against a foe you're aware of that's currently bearing a rune and within your first range increment. The ammunition homes in on your target, even going around corners. Your Strike doesn't require line of sight, ignores the target's @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Concealed] condition, and ignores all circumstance bonuses to AC granted from cover and shields.</p>",
