    "sourceBlob": "557be04a84ba8e5617bdcf4d76b69c097f498f71",
    "description": "<p>You know all too well the dangers of succumbing to fear, and you know how to remove this weakness from your allies. Attempt an @Check[intimidation|against:will] check, comparing it to the Will DC of allies in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:60] who can hear you. Each of them is temporarily immune to this ability for 10 minutes.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The ally gains temporary Hit Points equal to twice your level that remain for 1 round. The ally gains a +10-foot circumstance bonus to their Speeds for 1 round. Reduce the ally's frightened value by 2. If the ally wasn't frightened, they instead gain a +1 circumstance bonus to saving throws against fear for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The ally gains temporary Hit Points equal to your level that remain for 1 round. The ally gains a +5-foot circumstance bonus to their Speeds for 1 round. Reduce the ally's frightened value by 1. If the ally wasn't frightened, they instead gain a +1 circumstance bonus to their next saving throw against fear they attempt within the next minute.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Unfaltering Ranks]</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Unfaltering Ranks (Fear)]</p>",
