    "sourceBlob": "00ad1c226d2ce8093d772d9c57da47ebfcefa37a",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You are about to attempt a Fortitude or Reflex save against an area effect and are wielding a ranged weapon.</p><hr /><p>You defy the death and destruction around you while using it to fuel your mythic power, spurring you on to acts of incredible speed and empowering a mighty ranged counterattack. Spend a Mythic Point and attempt the triggering save at mythic proficiency. If the save is successful, you can immediately reload and make a ranged Strike targeting the originator of the triggering effect.</p>",
