    "sourceBlob": "6cf2803c214e9ee5ce203a21ac173f657a1a3013",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You are the target of a physical melee attack.</p><hr /><p>You talk so much it can be distracting to your enemies and you're often quick to remind your enemies that you're just a little guy! You don't need to be targeted! You don't need to be the focus of their frustrations! Have they tried writing to their mom or talking to a local priest of Desna? Ow!</p>\n<p>You gain a +2 circumstance bonus to your AC against the triggering attack.</p>",
