    "path": "packs/pf2e/feats/class/druid/level-20/verdant-presence.json",
    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/feats/class/druid/level-20/verdant-presence.json",
    "sourceBlob": "237815034a4b294607dadc17d0ff6ab1d70d9db8",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You take damage or cast a primal spell.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>The life-giving properties of the <em>aeon orbs</em> flourish within you. Small plants or fungi magically appear on all surfaces in a @Template[emanation|distance:60] around you. This life withers after 1 day unless the environment can support it. You can choose one of the following options each time you use this feat.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>You can cause any number of 5-foot squares in the area to be light undergrowth, which is difficult terrain and provides lesser cover.</li>\n<li>You can cause a tree or giant mushroom to appear in any unoccupied location in the area; it occupies an entire 5-foot square and provides standard cover. The tree or mushroom has 5 Hardness and 50 Hit Points.</li>\n</ul>",
    "plainDescription": "Frequency once per hour Trigger You take damage or cast a primal spell. The life-giving properties of the aeon orbs flourish within you. Small plants or fungi magically appear on all surfaces in a emanation area template distance 60 around you. This life withers after 1 day unless the environment can support it. You can choose one of the following options each time you use this feat. You can cause any number of 5-foot squares in the area to be light undergrowth, which is difficult terrain and provides lesser cover. You can cause a tree or giant mushroom to appear in any unoccupied location in the area; it occupies an entire 5-foot square and provides standard cover. The tree or mushroom has 5 Hardness and 50 Hit Points.",
    "descriptionHash": "60c6258d83aca72d4380930b0b4a57e822ff4c1cbe0a5530af8718dcb7d1cc2f",
