    "sourceBlob": "78ec1007b62ab9519dec81f75f811aad9f9bffe3",
    "description": "<p>Those afflicted by certain maladies are closer to death in your presence. Make a Strike against a creature. If your attack hits, the target must attempt a new saving throw against the highest-level disease or poison that is currently affecting it, possibly progressing it to a higher stage even if the affliction's interval hasn't passed. If the target successfully saves or critically saves against the affliction, the affliction's stage isn't reduced. If your attack was a critical hit, the target takes a –4 circumstance penalty to the save.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Virulent Strike]</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Those afflicted by certain maladies are closer to death in your presence. Make a Strike against a creature. If your attack hits, the target must attempt a new saving throw against the highest-level disease or poison that is currently affecting it, possibly progressing it to a higher stage even if the affliction's interval hasn't passed. If the target successfully saves or critically saves against the affliction, the affliction's stage isn't reduced. If your attack was a critical hit, the target takes a –4 circumstance penalty to the save. Effect: Virulent Strike",
