    "sourceBlob": "092748d060079ce7cc84c9bdabaf3041fd2b7d8f",
    "description": "<p>You can invoke runes from traditions that manipulate vital energy to restore flesh. You @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Invoke Rune]{Invoke} two Runes—one must be a divine rune, and one must be a primal rune. In addition to the runes' normal effects, one creature that's within 30 feet of both invoked runes regains Hit Points equal to 5 + double your level (@Damage[((@actor.level*2)+5)[healing]]).</p>",
    "plainDescription": "You can invoke runes from traditions that manipulate vital energy to restore flesh. You Invoke two Runes—one must be a divine rune, and one must be a primal rune. In addition to the runes' normal effects, one creature that's within 30 feet of both invoked runes regains Hit Points equal to 5 + double your level (damage healing).",
    "descriptionHash": "810fa35c157821dc64c549d9a8c1630552dd095e75d7f10fa1838ea2c8f9b232",
    "classification": "native-active",
