    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/feats/class/monk/level-20/vitality-manipulating-stance.json",
    "sourceBlob": "39250957a4fee20aaebfb7d9692d313a850800fa",
    "description": "<p>You have learned to attack meridians and pressure points like your rival Shino Hakusa. You gain a vitality blast ranged unarmed Strike that deals @Damage[1d4[void]] damage, has a range of 30 feet, and has the unarmed and versatile vitality traits.</p>\n<p>Additionally, when you use Stunning Fist, instead of saving against being stunned, you can choose to have the target make a Fortitude save against your class DC with the following results. You must choose to do this before the target rolls its save.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Stance: Vitality-Manipulating Stance]</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target's muscles become temporarily weaker. For 1 round, the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Enfeebled]{Enfeebled 2}, and any time it attempts to take an action with the manipulate trait, the action is disrupted unless it succeeds at a flat check with a DC equal to 5 + its enfeebled value.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> As success, but the duration is 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As success, but the duration is 1 minute, the flat check is DC 11, and the target takes –10-foot status penalty to all Speeds for the duration.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "You have learned to attack meridians and pressure points like your rival Shino Hakusa. You gain a vitality blast ranged unarmed Strike that deals damage void damage, has a range of 30 feet, and has the unarmed and versatile vitality traits. Additionally, when you use Stunning Fist, instead of saving against being stunned, you can choose to have the target make a Fortitude save against your class DC with the following results. You must choose to do this before the target rolls its save. Stance: Vitality Manipulating Stance Critical Success The target is unaffected. Success The target's muscles become temporarily weaker. For 1 round, the target is Enfeebled 2, and any time it attempts to take an action with the manipulate trait, the action is disrupted unless it succeeds at a flat check with a DC equal to 5 + its enfeebled value. Failure As success, but the duration is 1 minute. Critical Failure As success, but the duration is 1 minute, the flat check is DC 11, and the target takes –10-foot status penalty to all Speeds for the duration.",
