    "sourceBlob": "9f371b9a210c9490d9ea702108706a3e555eab7d",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An enemy in your kinetic aura damages you.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Lava reflexively explodes underneath you and the creature that hurt you. The triggering enemy takes @Damage[(floor((@actor.level -6)/4)+1)d6[fire]] damage with a @Check[reflex|against:kineticist|basic] save against your class DC. You @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Leap] up to half your Speed in any direction; this movement doesn't trigger reactions.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Level (+4)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Trigger An enemy in your kinetic aura damages you. Lava reflexively explodes underneath you and the creature that hurt you. The triggering enemy takes damage fire damage with a reflex check save against your class DC. You Leap up to half your Speed in any direction; this movement doesn't trigger reactions. Level (+4) The damage increases by 1d6.",
