    "sourceBlob": "2476be6743c59b6cb3f03dcca35c898ddc8f14de",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Sickened] condition or fail a saving throw against an ingested poison.</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p>In dire circumstances you can vomit out your stomach to expel toxins. Reduce your sickened condition by 2 and immediately attempt a saving throw with a +2 circumstance bonus against any ingested poisons you have been exposed to within the last minute. You become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] for 1 round as your exposed stomach makes you especially vulnerable to attacks.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Trigger You gain the Sickened condition or fail a saving throw against an ingested poison. Frequency once per day In dire circumstances you can vomit out your stomach to expel toxins. Reduce your sickened condition by 2 and immediately attempt a saving throw with a +2 circumstance bonus against any ingested poisons you have been exposed to within the last minute. You become Off Guard for 1 round as your exposed stomach makes you especially vulnerable to attacks.",
