    "sourceBlob": "56bbe436ea820be6e2ec8a7b5a8468e5340201a8",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You Rouse the World.</p><hr /><p>You have the world wake with a great convulsion. All other creatures in the area when you Rouse the World must attempt a @Check[reflex|against:class-spell] save against your world rouser DC.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature falls and lands @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Prone].</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the creature also becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 1}.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Trigger You Rouse the World. You have the world wake with a great convulsion. All other creatures in the area when you Rouse the World must attempt a reflex check save against your world rouser DC. Success The creature is unaffected. Failure The creature falls and lands Prone. Critical Failure As failure, but the creature also becomes Sickened 1.",
