    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/feats/ancestry/versatile-heritages/reflection/warped-reflection.json",
    "sourceBlob": "88c877f559c197c0943ab0a57d4209e8074b7ae3",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per minute</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Due to your origins, your form is more flexible than most. You shift your appearance to resemble a creature within 30 feet but with an unsettling, horrifying twist. Though this transformation is momentary, witnessing it gives the target deep existential dread. It must succeed at a @Check[will|against:class-spell] save against the higher of your class DC or spell DC or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 1} (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 2} on a critical failure) and be @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stupefied]{Stupefied 1} as long as the frightened condition lasts. Once you've used Warped Reflection against a creature, it's temporarily immune for 24 hours.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Frequency once per minute Due to your origins, your form is more flexible than most. You shift your appearance to resemble a creature within 30 feet but with an unsettling, horrifying twist. Though this transformation is momentary, witnessing it gives the target deep existential dread. It must succeed at a will check save against the higher of your class DC or spell DC or become Frightened 1 (Frightened 2 on a critical failure) and be Stupefied 1 as long as the frightened condition lasts. Once you've used Warped Reflection against a creature, it's temporarily immune for 24 hours.",
    "descriptionHash": "eb82feea0803a77afded3adadbb0a1f737089c43d6074b4058973fe337690917",
