    "sourceBlob": "f5a53b9d593dcc29abc0af15228d40591fb5e6d8",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p><hr /><p>You can harness the power of death to craft wings from bones and a thin membrane of flesh. You destroy a thrall within 30 feet, fusing it with your body and shaping it into gruesome, bony wings. You gain a fly Speed of 30 feet for 1 minute. You can Dismiss these wings. At 16th level, this action loses its frequency and gains an unlimited duration.</p>",
