    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are unarmored</p><hr /><p>You enter the stance of a wolf, low to the ground with your hands held like fangs. You can make wolf jaw unarmed attacks. These deal 1d8 piercing damage; are in the brawling group; and have the agile, backstabber, finesse, nonlethal, and unarmed traits.</p>\n<p>If you're flanking a target while in Wolf Stance, your wolf jaw unarmed attacks also gain the trip trait.</p>",
