    "publication": "Pathfinder Lost Omens Tian Xia Character Guide",
    "path": "packs/pf2e/feats/class/monk/level-14/world-breaking-footfall.json",
    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/feats/class/monk/level-14/world-breaking-footfall.json",
    "sourceBlob": "521e2d28db9e8e0ee92fe1af4e5b70ce07a38122",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are in @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Kaiju Stance] and are touching the ground.</p><hr /><p>You slam the ground and unleash a fearsome roar, sending broken shards of earth flying in all directions. The ground in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:20] around you becomes difficult terrain, or greater difficult terrain if it was already difficult terrain. All other creatures within the emanation take @Damage[7d6[bludgeoning]|options:area-damage] damage with a @Check[reflex|against:monk|basic|options:area-effect] save against your class DC. You then can't use World-breaking Footfall for [[/r 1d4 #Recharge World-Breaking Footfall]].</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Requirements You are in Kaiju Stance and are touching the ground. You slam the ground and unleash a fearsome roar, sending broken shards of earth flying in all directions. The ground in a type:emanation area template distance 20 around you becomes difficult terrain, or greater difficult terrain if it was already difficult terrain. All other creatures within the emanation take damage bludgeoning damage with a reflex check save against your class DC. You then can't use World-breaking Footfall for [[/r 1d4 #Recharge World-Breaking Footfall]].",
