    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/feats/archetype/worm-caller/worms-feast.json",
    "sourceBlob": "4ed08df46455ec5a2cbebaa5a7dd7afb0fe15d61",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You call forth a brood of infantile cave worms to feast on your enemy's flesh. Choose a creature within 30 feet; the creature must attempt a @Check[fortitude|against:class-spell] save. At 8th level and every 2 levels above that, the persistent piercing damage taken on a failure increases by 1d6.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The worms writhe away harmlessly.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes @Damage[2d6[piercing],2d6[persistent,piercing]] damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes @Damage[6d6[piercing],(max(2,floor((@actor.level -2)/2)))d6[persistent,piercing]] damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, plus the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] as long as it takes persistent piercing damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><em>Note: A DC was not provided for this ability by Paizo. The button above uses the better of your class or spell DC.</em></p>",
    "plainDescription": "Frequency once per day You call forth a brood of infantile cave worms to feast on your enemy's flesh. Choose a creature within 30 feet; the creature must attempt a fortitude check save. At 8th level and every 2 levels above that, the persistent piercing damage taken on a failure increases by 1d6. Critical Success The worms writhe away harmlessly. Success The target takes damage piercing damage. Failure The target takes damage piercing damage. Critical Failure As failure, plus the target is Off Guard as long as it takes persistent piercing damage. Note: A DC was not provided for this ability by Paizo. The button above uses the better of your class or spell DC.",
